 coach Adam Gase, with their Week 15 win over the New York Jets, the Dolphins clinched a winning record for the first time since 2008, and clinched a playoff berth the following week after which franchise's 47th season in the National Football League, the 57th overall and the fourth under head coach Andy Reid and the fourth and final season under general manager John Dorsey who was fired June 22, 2017?", "answer": "2016 Kansas City Chiefs season", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Volkswagen Golf Estate is the estate/station wagon version a the compact car which was the best selling car in Europe in what year?", "answer": "2001", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the name of the band that starred Belinda Carlisle and released the album, Germicide in 1977?", "answer": "The Go-Go's", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Logan Lerman starred in which 2017 drama directed by Shawn Christensen?", "answer": "Sidney Hall", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which plant, Buddleja or Burchardia, is an herb named after a German botanist?", "answer": "Burchardia", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What Brazilian professional footballer endorsed the Mercurial Vapor boot?", "answer": "Philippe Coutinho Correia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which film was released first, Roving Mars or The London Connection?", "answer": "The London Connection", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": " Blake Alexander Carrington is a fictional character on the ABC television series \"Dynasty\", created by Richard and Esther Shapiro whose role was portrayed by John Forsythe, and also appeared as a guest on several talk and variety shows and as a panelist on what type of television show?", "answer": "game shows", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Knocked Up starred the actor and filmmaker of what dual nationality?", "answer": "American-Canadian", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the capital of the archipelago where Djoi\u00e8zi is located?", "answer": "Moroni", "type": "bridge"}, {"q