itten by Amitabh Bhattacharya?", "answer": "Raees", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which jury member for Deutschland sucht den Superstar was an American model and choreographer born in 1957?", "answer": "Bruce Darnell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was the film A Taxi Driver released?", "answer": "South Korea", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was a single released in 1959 and peaked at number 4 on the \"Billboard\" Hot 100, performed by an American country-influenced rock and roll duo, known for steel-string acoustic guitar playing and close harmony singing?", "answer": "'Till) I Kissed You", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Have Peter Cetera and Jeremy McKinnon both been members of a band?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The 2010\u201311 Tour de Ski was the 5th edition of the Tour de Ski and took place from 31 December 2010 to which date, Swiss cross-country skier, Dario Cologna won the Men's class?", "answer": "9 January 2011", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the population according to the 2010 census of the census-designated place where Max Loughan created a crystal radio?", "answer": "8,777", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Meg is an upcoming American film staring a former what?", "answer": "MTV VJ", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was Curious George released along with the record company that produced the soundtrack for the movie?", "answer": "2006", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is a 2011 British action comedy film parodying the James Bond secret agent genre, that features a song by the band Primal Scream?", "answer": "Johnny English Reborn", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Ima Robot and Of Montreal music bands ?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "How long is the river on which Wilbur Dam is located?", "answer": "78.5 mi", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the busiest Amtrak route that does not stop at either Lortorn Station?", "answer": "The Northeast Re