rio is best known?", "answer": "Pierre Morel", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Whar did Sarfraz Ahmed do after Azhar Ali stepped down?", "answer": "He took up the Test captaincy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2007 FIFA U-20 World Cup was the sixteenth edition of the FIFA U-20 World Cup (formerly called FIFA World Youth Championship), hosted by Canada held during which span of dates, Argentine player Sergio Ag\u00fcero was given the FIFA U-20 Golden Shoe?", "answer": "30 June to 22 July 2007", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nickname for this United States drag racer who drove Brutus?", "answer": "Jungle Jim", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Milan based company made the tires for the Minardi M190?", "answer": "Pirelli", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was the NFL draft held in which Kenyatta Walker was selected in the first round by the Tampa Bay Buccaneers?", "answer": "Theater at Madison Square Garden", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "St Estevam is an Island in Ilhas, Goa, India, it is also known as 'Shakecho Juvo' - the isle of vegetables - known for its long, seven-ridged, light green ladyfingers, Okra or okro, known in many English-speaking countries as ladies' fingers or ochro, is a flowering plant in which family? ", "answer": "mallow", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was the captain that the USS Elrod is named after born?", "answer": "Turner County, Georgia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Aspects of Andrew Lloyd Webber is the second studio album by a singer that played what role in theAustralian premiere of \"The Phantom of the Opera\"? ", "answer": "Christine Daa\u00e9", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year did Tim Gaines leave the band whose eleventh release was \"The Roxx Regime Demos\"?", "answer": "2004", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "ND \u010crnu\u010de was managed in the mid-90s by the football coach of what nationality?", "answer": "Slovenian", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"State of Grace\