1 by Joseph Simmons, Darryl McDaniels, and Jason Mizell, was brought out by  the first rap crew from Dallas, Texas?", "answer": "Run-D.M.C.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Jimmy Rooney was on the Australia national soccer team and a member of what?", "answer": "1974 World Cup squad", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "At what school is the \"A Real Young Girl\" director a professor at?", "answer": "European Graduate School", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How did the first movie of the series that spawned Arthur 3: The War of the Two Worlds do internationally?", "answer": "It performed disappointingly", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the 1958 movie starring Sofia Costanza Brigida Villani Scicolone set?", "answer": "1941", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do both The Life and Times and Beth Orton originate from America?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "How tall is a Struthio camelus?", "answer": "2.75 m", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Was Winnie the Pooh or The Jungle Book released first?", "answer": "The Jungle Book", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which child actress began her career in 2006 and also stared in the television series The Emperor: Owner of the Mask?", "answer": "Kim So-hyun", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Silver City is a band that is an example of which genre, also known as avant-rock?", "answer": "Experimental rock", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Return to House on Haunted Hill is a sequel to a 1999 horror film directed by whom?", "answer": "William Malone", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is younger, Yevgeny Kafelnikov or Allan Stone?", "answer": "Yevgeny Aleksandrovich Kafelnikov", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What were the Royal Navy Battleships, that were considered the first fast battleships and were used in WWI and WWII?", "answer": "Queen Elizabeth\"-class battleships", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Harvey Milk is an American experimental rock/noise rock band that formed in Athens, Georgia in the early 1990s, one April Fool's Day gig at the 40 Watt in Athens, they performed R.E.M.'s \"Reckoning\" album from beginning to end, while which American singer, songwriter, musician, film producer, music video director, visual artist, and philanthropist, was in attendance?", "answer": "Michael Stipe", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the name of the Mafia faction headed by the person responsible for the assassination of Placido Rizzotto?", "answer": "Corleonesi", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What American composer who won the National Medal of Arts in 2007, also taught American composer Gregg Wager?", "answer": "Morten Lauridsen", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the director of the upcoming Candian drama film in which the actress who made her film d\u00e9but as the love interest in Wes Anderson's \"The Darjeeling Limited\" is starring?", "answer": "Xavier Dolan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What american actor who was in the film Like Mike, also played in 2012 American military science fiction action film loosely based on the board game of the same name?", "answer": "Jesse Lon Plemons", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year did Pietro Ferrero introduce his famous hazelnut cocoa product?", "answer": "1965", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What country do both Kevin Kennerley and Nantwich Town F.C. have in comman", "answer": "England", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What were the professions of the host of the documentary \"Anti-Semitism in the 21st Century: The Resurgence\"?", "answer": "journalist and writer.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the original name of the gazette that publishes Lytham St Annes Express?", "answer": "The West Lancashire Evening Gazette", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Derrick Delite's rap was featured on the remix and video version of a song by an American singer that  began her career as a cheerleader for who?", "answer": "Los Angeles Lakers", "type": "bridge"}, {"q