 winning film starring Eddie Redmayne?", "answer": "2000", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Kind of comapany headquartered in Saint-Denis comprises the technological and commercial institutions of filmmaking?", "answer": "motion picture company", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "One of the natives of Reggiolo was last manager of what German football club?", "answer": "Bayern Munich", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Beverley Knight MBE is an English recording artist heavily influenced by an American singer, songwriter, and what?", "answer": "entrepreneur", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were both Alexander Hall and Jon Amiel both considered film directors?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Vengeance of Rome (2006) is a novel by Michael Moorcock, in this novel, Colonel Pyat, an incarnation of the Eternal Champion, goes to Italy and Germany, where he becomes involved in Fascism and Naziism, including sexual encounters with which German military officer and an early member of the Nazi Party?", "answer": "Ernst Julius G\u00fcnther R\u00f6hm", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What county music artist first gained national attention as a winner on \"You Can Be a Star\" and wen on to provide background vocals in 199 on the 1992 release of the song \"Take It Like a Man\"?", "answer": "Lari Michele White", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Stephanie Sigman was an actress in the 2015 film produced by which company?", "answer": "Eon Productions", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Pylon and Team Sleep experimental bands?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Princess and the Frog starred a man who is best known for playing who? ", "answer": "Dan Conner", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Matt Doheny ran in the Republican primary for New York's 21st congressional district, a congressional district for the United States House of Representatives that is currently represented by who?", "answer": "Republican Elise Stefanik", "t