loped the first ironclad warship? ", "answer": "the Union", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which single by rap duo Mobb Deep was Curtis James Jackson III featured on?", "answer": "\"Creep\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which was released first, The Plow That Broke the Plains or The Man Who Skied Down Everest?", "answer": "The Plow That Broke the Plains", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What peer-reviewed scientific journal published approximately monthly by Springer Science+Business Media was Zden\u011bk \u0160vestka co-founder and editor of?", "answer": "Solar Physics", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was this British archaeologist and officer in the British Army contributed to the excavation of Stone Age and megalithic sites of South India with K. V. Soundararajan?", "answer": "Mortimer Wheeler", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is the headquarters of the company who launched the Fridge advertising campaign?", "answer": "London, England", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are the Lancashire Heeler and the Glen of Imaal Terrier both listed by the Kennel Club (UK) as a vulnerable breed?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the main base of the airline co-founded by John Nicolaas Block?", "answer": "Amsterdam Airport Schiphol", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The mud pie served by n.y.d.c. Caf\u00e9 & Restaurants is likely to have originated in what U. S. state?", "answer": "Mississippi.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which was released first, Dangal or The Wild?", "answer": "The Wild", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Democracy Day is possible federal holiday proposed by a politician that represents which US congressional district?", "answer": "13th", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which football team that was relegated to Tercera Divisi\u00f3n in the 1962\u201363 Segunda Divisi\u00f3n season was founded in 1958?", "answer": "Sevilla Atl\u00e9tico", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birthdate 