erican television series?", "answer": "The Pacific", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What  is a low-cost airline headquartered at Gurgaon, that is the largest airline in India, the third largest domestic airline being the flag carrier airline of India ?", "answer": "IndiGo", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which city is in the Western area of Ireland which is also the home of Sean Smyth?", "answer": "Galway", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is affiliated with the University of Engineering and Technology, Taxila, Center for Advanced Studies in Engineering or Temple University?", "answer": "Center for Advanced Studies In Engineering", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which English actor starred in \u201cHollywood Goes Classical\" which was performed at the Dorothy Chandler Pavilion?", "answer": "Michael York", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " \"Wij zijn Ajax\" features rap parts from a Dutch footballer who plays for what Turkish club?", "answer": "Be\u015fikta\u015f", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What section of the canal that passes through Yealand Redmayne was never completed?", "answer": "The section around the crossing of the River Ribble", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where are the headquarters of the league the Denver Pioneers play in?", "answer": "Elmhurst, Illinois", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Space Ducks features songs from the band started by Ruben Nielson, who was formerly of what group?", "answer": "The Mint Chicks", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which of Chan Yung-jan and Svetlana Kuznetsova has appeared in more Gland Slam finals?", "answer": "Svetlana Aleksandrovna Kuznetsova", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was the mother of the man who was King of England from 1483 to 1485?", "answer": "Cecily Neville", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Rhiwallon ap Cynfyn, was a Welsh King, following the 1063 invasion of Wales by Harold and Tostig Godwinson, he was an Anglo-Saxon Earl of which location, that overthrew Gruffydd, Rh