le of Mogadishu", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bryan Brown performed in what 1984 British musical drama that was directed by Peter Webb?", "answer": "Give My Regards to Broad Street", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " What the locals consider for a suburb of a town which is in the Division of Mayo?", "answer": "township of Stirling", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What country of origin does Jerk and Dean Corll have in common?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When did the head of government of Albania officially mandate his 9th Cabinet?", "answer": "September 2017", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In between Ludwig van Beethoven and Heinrich Marschner who was the most important composer of German opera between Weber and Wagner?", "answer": "Heinrich August Marschner", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What movie was produced first, Muppet Treasure Island or Honey, I Shrunk the Kids?", "answer": "Honey, I Shrunk the Kids", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What reusable contactless stored value smart card for making electronic payments in online or offline systems in Hong Kong replaced the Common stored value ticket in 1997?", "answer": "Octopus card", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Pal Dukagjiniwas part of a military alliance that was founded by which Albanian nobleman?", "answer": "Skanderbeg", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "MedStar Georgetown University Hospital and Walter Reed Army Medical Center, are both which type of medical facilities?", "answer": "Hospital", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are both Sergei Sobolev and Mikhail Leonidovich Gromov members of the IH\u00c9S in France?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The 357th Fighter Squadron (357 FS) is part of the 355th Fighter Wing at Davis-Monthan Air Force Base, Arizona, it operates which The 357th Fighter Squadron (357 FS) is part of the 355th Fighter Wing at Davis-Monthan Air Force Base, Arizona??", "answer": "Fairchild Republic A-10 Thund