ablished the Home District Council born?", "answer": "1752", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which character did Moira Kelly voice in this 1994 animated film?", "answer": "Nala", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which composer did Beethoven regard as the greatest of his contemporaries: Franz Schreker or Luigi Cherubini?", "answer": "Luigi Cherubini", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What actor from The Imitation Game also starred in \"Revolver\", \"RocknRolla\" and \"Sherlock Holmes\"?", "answer": "Mark Strong", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Trevor nunn has directed what non musical show besides Birdsong", "answer": "Macbeth", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who first proposed the physics theory, known to have been later independently proposed in a more complete paper by the current tenured professor at the University of Amsterdam, and director and Leon Levy professor at the Institute for Advanced Study in Princeton?", "answer": "Lubo\u0161 Motl", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Peter Facinelli is known for his role as Mike Dexter in a 1998 American teen comedy film that was written and directed by Deborah Kaplan and who?", "answer": "Harry Elfont", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Indo-American public speaker and advocate was Miss America in 2014?", "answer": "Nina Davuluri", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Howard University Hospital and Providence Hospital are both located where?", "answer": "Washington, D.C.", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What sort of art did Herbert Abrams complete using the Chief of Staff of the United States Army from 1968 to 1972 as a subjecy?", "answer": "portrait", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which operetta does Lamplighters Music Theature feature that was composed by Leonard Bernstein?", "answer": "Candide", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which national park is located in Galicia, Spain; the Atlantic Islands of Galicia National Park or Caldera de Taburiente National Park?", "answer": "Atlantic Islands of Gali