: "Fascism", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of category does Origanum and Athyrium have in common?", "answer": "genus", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Woman is Dangerous stars an American film and television actress who began her career as a dancer and what else?", "answer": "stage showgirl", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nationality of the actor who played the role of George Dunlop in the film Shoot the Moon?", "answer": "English", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The actor Michael Keaton play a role that opened what restaurant in 1954?", "answer": "McDonald's fast food chain", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ethan Phillips plays the character Neelix in what sci-fi tv series?", "answer": "\"\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Joshua Dugdale and Richard Benjamin both actors?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Francis Farewell Starlite is an American musician, producer, songwriter, and is the frontman of which American musical group project?", "answer": "Francis and the Lights", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Nita Kumar completed her Ph.D. from the University of Chicago in History and has taught at the University of Chicago, Brown University, and the University of Michigan among other places, she presently holds the Brown Family Chair of South Asian History at which independent, coeducational and private liberal arts college with a curricular emphasis on economics, finance, international relations, government and public affairs, located in Claremont, California, United States?", "answer": "Claremont McKenna College (CMC)", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what county is the company that KZQD is licensed to located?", "answer": "Seward County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Trevor McNevan and Leslie West both citizens on the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What genuses does Pleioblastus and Tibouchina belong to?", "answer": "Melastomataceae Juss", "type": "