ctor Jackie Vernon worked in a 1976 animated Christmas television special which is owned by who? ", "answer": "by Warner Bros.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Whose album was Red?", "answer": "Taylor Swift", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do John Lanchester and Paul Val\u00e9ry have the same nationality ?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The man, known for his guitar showmanship and founded Led Zeppelin, was born in what year?", "answer": "1944", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do Victoria Larimore and James Cameron share the same nationality?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was born more recently, Bryan Howard, or Maurice Greene?", "answer": "Bryan Howard", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Squealer is a fictional character, a pig, in which author's book, \"Animal Farm\", in the book, he is described as merely a fat pig, but in the 1954 film, he is a pink pig, whereas in the 1999 film, Animal Farm, he is a Tamworth pig who wears a monocle? ", "answer": "George Orwell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Eleven Times Square is located directly across from the main gateway for interstate buses that opened in what year?", "answer": "1950", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were both Henry James and Charlotte Perkins Gilman both american writers?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What are alternate names for the type of roof on Ravenswood, a historic home located near Bunceton, Missouri?  ", "answer": "\"French roof\" or \"curb roof\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "270 Park Avenue and The Spiral, are located in which city?", "answer": "New York City", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The 2011 Major League Soccer All-Star Game, held on July 27, 2011, was the 16th annual Major League Soccer All-Star Game, Manchester United won the game 4\u20130 with goals from players, including Daniel Nii Tackie Mensah Welbeck, an English professional footballer who plays for which organization, club Arsena