hetic when he fixed a broken nose with a pair of pliers?", "answer": "Jack Daniel's", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Cyathea and Carpobrotus similar plants?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who directed the 2008 film for which Eddie Marson won Best Supporting Actor?", "answer": "Mike Leigh", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Notes from the Outernet is a book of photographs taken by the actor who achieved recognition for his role on what 1994 TV series?", "answer": "My So-Called Life", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was host of 2016 KBS Drama Awards Kim Ji-won born?", "answer": "October 19, 1992", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What movie was released 64 years after the original film, which includes Thumper, a fictional rabbit character from Disney?", "answer": "Bambi II", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the population of the geographical region with a relatively high population density at its core and close economic ties throught the area that is in Lebanon Country, Pennsylvania?", "answer": "7,096", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Keith Justin Hetrick has worked with an American rapper who is best known for \"Watch Me (Whip/Nae Nae), which reached what number on the Billboard Hot 100?", "answer": "three", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Saint Paul, Minnesota, is which of the largest metropolitan areas in the US? ", "answer": "16th-largest", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Letter from a Thief is by a band formed in what Chicago suburb?", "answer": "Wildwood, Illinois", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the brother of dancer Gregory Hines and creator of Uptown... It's Hot! born?", "answer": "born December 13, 1943", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which architect designed the building in which Mervyn Herbert was born ?", "answer": "Charles Barry,", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Does the genus Phoenix have more known species than the genus Dichroa?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "For w