n?", "answer": "1892", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Hydra is an album by Within Temptation and contains guest appearances by an American metalcore vocalist best known for being the vocalist of what two bands?", "answer": "Killswitch Engage and Blood Has Been Shed", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the first European Space Agency astronaut to command a space mission, Patrick Baudry or Frank De Winne?", "answer": "Frank, Viscount De Winne", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the name of the American football coach born in 1967, who is in his fifth season, as of 2017, with the Idaho Vandals football team?", "answer": "Paul Petrino", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the rapper who was featured by Goldie Loc on his album Eastsideridaz who died on MArch 15, 2011?", "answer": "Nate Dogg", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were Michael Winner and Guy Hamilton both English film directors?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which album has the re-recorded version of Lords of Summer and holds the record for having longest gap between its previous album?", "answer": "Hardwired... to Self-Destruct", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the actor who starred in the movie Gryphon and as the voice of Pops in \"Johnny Bravo\" born? ", "answer": "February 21, 1950", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Known for his voice-over as \"Ren and Stimpy\", this actor also voiced what character on \"Futurama\"?", "answer": "Philip J. Fry", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which part of the Mount Lofty Ranges is part of the Electoral district of Davenport?", "answer": "Adelaide Hills", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Shinee contains which South Korean singer born in Gwangmyeong?", "answer": "Lee Jin-ki", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the subject of the 2015 film \"Woman in Gold\" born?", "answer": "1916", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Early Tapes of The Beatles is the first digital repackaging of the 1