igners of the Declaration of Independence?", "answer": "Gwinnett County in the U.S. state of Georgia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Keenen Ivory Wayans and Fruit Chan both filmmakers?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What television adaptation contains a character who was also adapted into a 2005 superhero film?", "answer": "Gotham", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Woody Allen and Frederick Wiseman both filmmakers?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the release year of this horror film produced by Val Lewton and directed by the same person who directed \"Out of the Past\" and \"I Walked with a Zombie\"?", "answer": "1942", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which mathematician was born first,  Ivan Fesenko or Dmitri Anosov?", "answer": "Dmitri Victorovich Anosov", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What 2006 criminal case led by Mike Nifong was the basis of an episode of \"Law & Order\"?", "answer": "The Duke lacrosse case", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Cathy Berberian and Marco Khan are both actors, correct?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What model of aircraft is part of the PA-28 family of aircrafts and can also be rented from the Freeway Airport?", "answer": "PA28R-200 IFR", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the sportscaster who did play by play for ABC in 1978 born ?", "answer": "October 18, 1928", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What singer with a distinctive contralto voice reached top 10 in 1987?", "answer": "Cher", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What city located in Florida is the birthplace of the Rector of Most Holy Trinity Seminary?", "answer": "Brooksville", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was the singer of the album \"Delta\" born and raised ?", "answer": "Sydney, New South Wales", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Akihiro Gono is only one of six to  beat the DREAM Light Heavyweight Champion and former Strikeforce Light Heavyweight Champion tha