": "eight", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Spring Session M is an album produced by a British record producer/engineer widely known for being one of the five main engineers for who?", "answer": "The Beatles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The anime series Deltora Quest made its Pakistani debut on a TV channel created by what company?", "answer": "Turner International Pakistan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "House Party 3 features the debut of an American actor born in what year?", "answer": "1971", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Did George Lucas and Lewis Allen work in the same country?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which illusionist known for his work as half of the team Penn & Teller has been featured in the weekly radio series Jazz Inspired?", "answer": "Penn Jillette", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What profession does Jack Green and Gerard Kuiper have in common?", "answer": "professor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When did the romantic drama based on a 2010 Julie Maroh compete against \"Venus in Fur\" for Best Film?", "answer": "20 January 2014", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which readers was the series The Lost Journals of Ven Polypheme published for?", "answer": "readers in their youth", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Artie Maddicks was created by Bob Layton and what American comic artist who worked in the comics industry since the 1980s?", "answer": "Jackson \"Butch\" Guice", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birth date of this American football coach and former player, who led the 2016 Penn State Nittany Lions football team in their third year?", "answer": "February 2, 1972", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which album is newer, \"Joshua Judges Ruth\" or \"Natural Forces\"?", "answer": "Natural Forces", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Mecklenburg Investment Company Building is associated with what movement that was originally called the \"New Negro\" movement?", "answer": "Harlem Renaissance