ationality was the coach who trained the 15th overall 1996 NHL Entry Draft pick from?", "answer": "Ukrainian", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Vienna Blood is a German film that took in 7 million of which German currency, used between 1924-48?", "answer": "Reichsmark", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Joey Gathright was an outfielder for which AL Central team?", "answer": "Kansas City Royals", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bowling has been part of the pan american games since the games held in which city ?", "answer": "Havana, Cuba", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nationality of the star of \"The Look of Love\"?", "answer": "English", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many times has the man who led the league in assists in the 2011-2012 NBA season been an NBA All-star so far?", "answer": "four-time", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which filmmaker would be more likely to produce work with drawings rather than real actors, Jan \u0160vankmajer or Lambert Hillyer", "answer": "Jan \u0160vankmajer", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "How long did the War of the Roses last where Henry Beaufort was an important Lancastrian military commander?", "answer": "between 1455 and 1487", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What president was assassinated in an explosion on August 1981, and was succeeded by a man elected as the new Supreme Leader by the Assembly of Experts on 4 June 1989 at the age of 49?", "answer": "President Mohammad-Ali Rajai", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birthdate of this American director, screenwriter, and producer, who reunited with Tom Cross on the romantic comedy \"La La Land\"?", "answer": "January 19, 1985", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was the actor born who portrayed the character that was a small-time pot dealer in We're the Millers?", "answer": "1975", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Murray Grigor and Leslie H. Martinson both Scottish directors?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"questi