ced by dream works animation?", "answer": "Eric \"Bibo\" Bergeron", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Not Counting You, is a song written, and recorded by which American country music artist?", "answer": "Garth Brooks", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Player Draft was held at Gaddafi Stadium and initial squads were finalised in Decenber 2015?", "answer": "2016 Pakistan Super League players draft", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What country was the businessman who founded an American hip hop apparel company? ", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When did the television series starring Anthony Michael \"Tony\" Oller as Walt Moore first air?", "answer": "October 8, 2010", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which university with which David D. Balam was a research associate is a large public research university located in Victoria, British Columbia, Canada?", "answer": "University of Victoria", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who You Are was on an album that followed what album?", "answer": "Vitalogy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Plutonium from the Hanford Site comes film which U.S. state?", "answer": "the U.S. state of Washington.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which 18th President of the United States was present at the Battle of Young's Point?", "answer": "Ulysses S. Grant", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Italian composer Donizetti's opera \"Maria Stuarda\" is based on a play by Friedrich Schiller about the final das of which royal figure?", "answer": "Mary, Queen of Scots", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the size of the mall situated between the cities of Dallas and Fort Worth, Texas?", "answer": "over 1600000 sqft", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the seat of the county that is home to the Mahogany Mountains?", "answer": "Pioche", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Alan Hancock was a former member of the British Union of Fascists, which was formed by which British politician who rose to fame in the 1920s as a M