er": "SomeKindaWonderful", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the president and CEO in 1988  of an American regional airline headquartered at Dayton International Airport in Vandalia, Ohio ?", "answer": "Keith Houk", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Barry Dickins wrote a film about the last person executed in Australia named what?", "answer": "Ronald Joseph Ryan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Lake Yojoa and Lake Tanganyika on the same continent?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which Bristol trip hop group did Paul Oakenfold do a remix for ?", "answer": "Massive Attack", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bender \"Ben\" Johnson Jr. was the chairman of the Makah during the first successful hunt of Eschrichtius robustus which is commonly known as what?", "answer": "The gray whale", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Between Body of War and When We Were Kings, which film's location is closer to Israel?", "answer": "Body of War", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Cheryl Stephanie Burke best known for being one of the professional dancers on an American dance competition television series and is the US version of what UK series?", "answer": "Strictly Come Dancing", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "During what movie was Evan Rachel Wood approximately 24 years old?", "answer": "The Ides of March", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The American actor \"Jonathan Joss\" participated in which American animated sitcom that centers around the middle-class American family in the fictional city in Texas?", "answer": "King of the Hill", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What English film, theatre, television and opera director has worked with Femi Elufowoju Jr.?", "answer": "Richard Eyre", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Maryland Democratic Party has a state chair of the former public affairs officer for what company?", "answer": "Marriott International", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is a Bulgarian operatic soprano that had their career