o features on an album of covers of Gram Parsons' songs, hail from?", "answer": "Athens, Georgia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"I'm in Disgrace\" is the opening track on the second side of which English rock band formed in Muswell Hill, North London,1975 concept album, \"Schoolboys in Disgrace\"?", "answer": "The Kinks", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Cross country running is a sport in which teams and individuals run a race on open-air courses over natural terrain such as?", "answer": "dirt or grass", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Lucie \u0160af\u00e1\u0159ov\u00e1 and Pavel Slo\u017eil both Czech tennis players?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What ranking is based on team performance over 4 years and of which one Australia team is ranked 25th?", "answer": "IIHF World Ranking", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who created the character in \"The Closer\" in which the actor also played in the movie \"Mannequin\"?", "answer": "James Duff", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Eileen Elizabeth Sheridan was known for her association with a firm headed by  English gangsters who were the foremost perpetrators of what in the East End of London?", "answer": "organised crime", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the film director who directed a famous movie trilogy highlighting the classic film \"Viridiana\", that starred one of the actors in the Mexican comedy film \"My Three Merry Widows\"?", "answer": "Luis Bu\u00f1uel", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the nationality of the semiotician who developed the Actantial model in 1966", "answer": "French-Lithuanian", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What decade that is type of Art Deco architecture that is the style of the Earle Micajah Winslow House emerge?", "answer": "1930s", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was William T. Anderson the leader of in the Centralia Massacre?", "answer": "pro-Confederate guerrilla leaders", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Prince