ton Phoenix A-League made his professional debut against Melbourne City FC, located where?", "answer": "Victoria", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What non-fiction books has the author who has written books about the loyalist paramilitary Michael Stone and Special Air Service founder who During the course of the Second World War he became one of the British Army's most highly decorated soldiers?", "answer": "the Troubles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How long ago did the the species associated with KNM ER 1805 live?", "answer": "2.1 and 1.5 million years ago", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "One type of shop that sells butter pies had how many shops in the UK in the 1930s?", "answer": "35,000", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which novel was the opera at which Artyom Melikhov has his first appearance based?", "answer": "\"War and Peace\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which magazine was founded first The Progressive or Cosmopolitan ?", "answer": "Cosmopolitan", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Roshon Fegan and Camp Rock are associated with what major entertainment company?", "answer": "Disney", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the comedy starring Shane McDermott and an actor known for his role in \"Bernie\" released?", "answer": "1993", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2011 Copa del Rey was a specific type of rivalry, given this name to any match between which groups?", "answer": "Real Madrid and FC Barcelona", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Charles Francis \"Frank\" Keeney Jr. was a union organizer during a war between which two factions ?", "answer": "between coal companies and miners", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Paul C. Donnelly's first manned launch was that of the astronaut and businessman of what nationality?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Curse of the Faceless Man starred the actor who was of what nationality?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Out of the two members 