ustralian actor born, best known for his role in soap operas and also a star of Puppy?", "answer": "27 March 1974", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What country of origin does Vichy France and Philippe P\u00e9tain have in common?", "answer": "French", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Nymagee is a small town near what town in the center of New South Wales?", "answer": "Nyngan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Faena Art Center is the cultural center of the Faena District Buenos Aires, a residential and cultural community in the Puerto Madero waterfront in Buenos Aires, which Argentine hotelier and real estate developer, founded the center?", "answer": "Alan Faena", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the middle name of the host of the Comedy Central show rated No. 1 among 18-24 year old men in its time slot?", "answer": "Dwight", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Hedgehog in the Fog is directed by the animator of what nationality?", "answer": "Soviet and Russian", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which genus contains more species, Scilla or Anemonopsis?", "answer": "Scilla", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was a Venezuelan intellectual, lawyer, journalist, writer, television producer and politician, John Kenneth Galbraith or Arturo Uslar Pietri ?", "answer": "Arturo Uslar Pietri", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Valeria Valeryevna Lukyanova has a striking resemblance to a doll created by what American businesswoman?", "answer": "Ruth Handler", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What County does Route 97 continue to after going through Essex County?", "answer": "Rockingham County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who starred in the movie Bullitt?", "answer": "Steve McQueen", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What film was Sai Chand in that was written and directed by Sekhar Kammula?", "answer": "Fidaa", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the species type of this early herbivorous dinosaur that was the subject of a paper written by Matt J. Wedel?