ersity of Texas at Austin in the 2002 NCAA Division I-A football season, the team was led on the field by senior quarterback Chris Simms, a former American football quarterback, who played in which organization?", "answer": "National Football League (NFL)", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "...And Justice for All is a studio album from Metallican that was the first to feature the bassist who was also part of which other bands?", "answer": "Voivod and Flotsam and Jetsam", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Won Shin-yun, is a South Korean film director, he has shown strong talent in which 2013 South Korean spy-action thriller film?", "answer": "The Suspect", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What network did the series that \"Diwali\" was an episode of air on?", "answer": "NBC", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what country are the magazines Weatherwise and Lindy's Sports located?", "answer": "United States", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Nintendo Power Line was revived in celebration of the console that had how many built-in games?", "answer": "30", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How long did the dynasty that Gustav Adolf von Wulffen was born in last?", "answer": "from 1826 to 1918", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What English lyricist wrote the lyrics for the Doug Henning inspired musical Merlin?", "answer": "Don Black", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is in the boy band Infinite, Nam Woo-hyun or Tom Smith?", "answer": "Nam Woo-hyun", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the name of the movie  directed by Vernon Sewell in 1971 that is based on 16 murders commited over a period of 10 months in1828 in Edinburgh, Scotland?", "answer": "Burke & Hare", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What 2010 musical was written by the same author as a whodunnit novel similar to \"Big Brother\" ", "answer": "Love Never Dies", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Among Ted Sharks and Chantal Akerman who is known for more films?", "answer": "Ted Sharks", "type": "compa