er": "Tony Martin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the elevation of the field at which the 2007 Las Vegas Bowl was held?", "answer": "1600 ft", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nationality of the American actor and film producer who portrayed Monte in the made-for-TV remake set in Wyoming of Monte Walsh?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What 2014 Heisman Trophy winner was a first round pick by the Tampa Bay Buccaneers in the 2015?", "answer": "Jameis Winston", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Gell-Mann\u2013Nishijima formula was proposed by an American physicist who received a Nobel Prize in what year?", "answer": "1969", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "are Il re pastore and King Priam both Operas ?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In which city did this world games take place when Squash was added as part of the world games?", "answer": "Lahti, Finland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was Jack Harvey born that is approximately 8 mi south-west from the city and county town of Lincoln?", "answer": "Bassingham", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What county in New Jersey was Blondie Purcell born in?", "answer": "Passaic County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Italian amateur boxer beat Tumba Silva in the 2012 Olympics?", "answer": "Clemente Russo", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What duet performed Peace on Earth/Little Drummer Boy", "answer": "Crosby and Bowie", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Saeed Rizvi and John Huston, have which occupation?", "answer": "film director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is best known as the frontman of the California punk rock band Lagwagon, Joey Cape or Scott Weiland?", "answer": "Randal Joseph \"Joey\" Cape", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Hans Kammler was the last in Germany to be appointed to the paramilitary rank first created in what year?", "answer": "1932", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What company produced both The