ty ?", "answer": "Knox County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In how many World Cups has the English striker who once played for IFK H\u00e4ssleholm appeared as a member of the English national team?", "answer": "two", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where did the actor who played sidekick Toothy in Sugarfoot serve prior to acting?", "answer": "the United States Navy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When does a speaker of The State of the Black Union born who is the U.S. Representative for 's 13th congressional district? ", "answer": "May 16, 1929", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is a heavy metal band, Gary Braver or System of a Down?", "answer": "System of a Down", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The band Felix Haug was the drummer and keyboardist for was best known for what hit single?", "answer": "\"The Captain of Her Heart\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A Wish Way is a device that appears in three of the Oz books of Ruth Plumly Thompson, one being The Lost King of Oz, released in which year, and is the nineteenth in the series of Oz books?", "answer": "1925", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Vitim Airport is a public use airport built in Vitim, Sakha (Yakutia) Republic, Russia during World War II for the Alaska-Siberian (ALSIB) air route used to ferry which policy aircraft, formally titled \"An Act to Promote the Defense of the United States?", "answer": "Lend-Lease", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Southern Girl City Lights is what by an American country pop singer-songwriter and reality television personality?", "answer": "the second studio album", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The municipality in which Vatnvatnet lies is part of what traditional region?", "answer": "Salten", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"There Goes Another Love Song\" was written by an American singer best known as a guitarist for who?", "answer": "Lynyrd Skynyrd", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What one-act ballet's music was written by an Austrian compos