 first, The Anderson Platoon or Anvil! The Story of Anvil?", "answer": "The Anderson Platoon", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which magazine was published first, Rays from the Rose Cross or Teen Vogue?", "answer": "Rays from the Rose Cross", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Between Jo Kwon and David Johansen, which has held the more numerous range of occupations?", "answer": "Jo Kwon", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is XY and Tikkun?", "answer": "XY is a gay men's magazine", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What  area was named \"Victoria Square\" by the Street Naming Committee on 23 May 1837, after Princess Victoria, that has colonial-era building in the Adelaide city centre across from King William Street ?", "answer": "Victoria Square", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Houston, we have a problem\" was an erroneous quote between \"Huston\" and an American test pilot, NASA astronaut and one of how many people who have flown to the moon?", "answer": "24", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 1994 Asian Games also known as XII Asiad were held from October 2 to October 16, 1994 in which capital of Hiroshima Prefecture and the largest city in the Ch\u016bgoku region of western Honshu - the largest island of Japan?", "answer": "Hiroshima", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Ricky Hatton vs. Paulie Malignaggi boxing match took place in 2008 at a casino opened in what year?", "answer": "1993", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the prince who attended NHH Symposium with The Norwegian king, Harald V  born? ", "answer": "20 July 1973", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What title dramatisation took place in East Riding of Yorkshire?", "answer": "The Battle of Stamford Bridge", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Between the two films Woodstock and Target for Tonight, which one was released earlier?", "answer": "Target for Tonight", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What film was released more recently, The Legend of Lobo or Amy?", "answer"