n what year?", "answer": "1983", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Mysterious Mr. Wong is a tongue-in-cheek 1934 mystery film starring Bela Lugosi as a powerful type of which fictional character introduced in a series of novels by British author Sax Rohmer during the first half of the twentieth century?", "answer": "Fu Manchu", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Stromanthe and Salvia in different plant families", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "which competition did Ekaterina Vasilieva compete in pairs with the russian pair skater who teamed up with Yuko Kavaguti and win two-time European champions (2010, 2015), two-time World bronze medalists (2009, 2010), two-time ISU Grand Prix Final bronze medalists (11\u201312 and 15\u201316), and three-time Russian national champions (2008\u20132010) ?", "answer": "2006 World Junior Championships", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Bank Account\" is a song by a rapper born in which year ?", "answer": "1992", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Kangchenjunga and Trivor both mountains?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What type of aircraft did the Italian engineer Enrico Forlanini work on that was an aerostat?", "answer": "airship", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which county does the Baltimore & Annapolis Trai, that ends in Glen Burnie, Maryland, finish?", "answer": "Anne Arundel County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which movie staring Amy Adams earned Eric Heisserer a nomination for Best Adapted Screenplay?", "answer": "Arrival", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who stayed in the Charles Walker House and invented the Confederate flag?", "answer": "Nicola Marschall", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many miles away from Dallas is the village that the species depicted in the Pictish stone at Golspie originated from?", "answer": "three miles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where was the first store that the grandfather of Elinor S. Gimbel's husband located?", "answer": "Vincennes, Indiana", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Rajania and Rothmannia both types of plants?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Jeff Lynne and Chantal Claret singers?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Returning Home (Norwegian: \u00c5 vende tilbake ) is a 2015 Norwegian drama film directed by Henrik Martin Dahlsbakken,  It was one of three films shortlisted by Norway to be their submission for the Academy Award for Best Foreign Language Film at the 88th Academy Awards, but it lost out to which 2015 Norwegian catastrophe drama film, directed by Roar Uthaug?", "answer": "The Wave", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Poppy Computer was created by which Los Angeles YouTube personality?", "answer": "Poppy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "George Nolfi directed what science fiction thriller film that was produced by Chris Moore and stars Matt Damon and who?", "answer": "Emily Blunt", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Outside Tour was a tour by a musician who was  inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in what year ?", "answer": "1996", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was Lynne Ann Cheney's husband born? ", "answer": "January 30, 1941", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who have more species of plants, Manettia or Guzmania?", "answer": "Manettia", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Hawthorne Heights and Black Light Burns both emo bands?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was caretaker manager before Neil Harris and is a northern Irish former professional footballer?", "answer": "Steve Lomas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do both Jack Finney and Thomas Keneally have the same nationality ? ", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "When was Justin Vincent the MVP of a collegiate championship game?", "answer": "January 4, 2004", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which song, that Shelly Fabian of About.com ranked the song number 169 on her list of the Top 5