aine Maury is known for located?", "answer": "Salta Province, Argentina", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Warehouse management system are what type of platforms?", "answer": "technology platforms", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What spectrum helps us distinguish far left politics?", "answer": "The left\u2013right political spectrum", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the player who made his debut for the Los Angeles Rams against the New York Giants on November 11, 1990 born ?", "answer": "May 22, 1964", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what show does Frederick G. Nolan seek the treasure of historical artifacts on an island of the coast of Nova Scotia, Canada?", "answer": "The Curse of Oak Island", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which game is older, Twilight Imperium or Amun-Re?", "answer": "Twilight Imperium", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": " V\u00edtor Vianna is a Brazilian mixed martial artist, who has competed in mixed martial arts events in Brazil, Holland, and in the United States, this ranking is due to certain fights, of which type, that he has participated in which term used in combat sports such as boxing and mixed martial arts to describe a weight limit for odd class fights?", "answer": "Catchweight", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the landmark museum and restaurant in New York city owned bySamuel Fraunces? ", "answer": "Fraunces Tavern", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the HBO play adaptation  about A Gay Fantasia on National Themes, stars Meryl Streep?", "answer": "Angels in America", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "No Fixed Address is the eighth studio album by which Canadian rock band formed in 1995 in Hanna, Alberta, Canada, and released on November 14, 2014 via Republic Records?", "answer": "Nickelback", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2010 Pentagon shooting was an attack upon the headquarters of which U.S. department?", "answer": "the U.S. Department of Defense", "type": "bridge"}, {"questio