lm director best known for writing  \"The Perks of Being a Wallflower\", that wrote the screenplay for Beauty and the Beast?", "answer": "Stephen Chbosky", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many conflicts were the wars of which Thomas James Maling was a captain categorized?", "answer": "five", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Franprix is a grocery store chain belonging to which retailer whose majority shareholder is Rallye SA?", "answer": "Groupe Casino", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What town on the Castletown River was the home of a famous radiologist who lived from 1900-1979", "answer": "Dundalk", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which American politician, soldier, and diplomat born in 1819 commanded the Second Military District of the U.S. Army?", "answer": "Daniel Sickles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What role did Mehrdad Raissi Ardali voice in the 2013 American 3D computer-animated musical fantasy film produced by Walt Disney Animation Studios and released by Walt Disney Pictures?", "answer": "Kristoff", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what month was the current head coach of the Oklahoma Sooners born?", "answer": "September", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What other weapons besides the QF 2-pounder naval gun, so named because of the sound it made when fired, were there on the HMS Foylebank?", "answer": "0.5 inch (12.7 mm) machine guns", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the last year that Julia Haworth played as the nanny of Joshua?", "answer": "2011", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Get Bruce starred the actress and writer who started her career in what capacity?", "answer": "stand-up comedian", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Was it Bearno's Pizza or Aurelio's Pizza that has locations in 6 different states?", "answer": "Aurelio's Pizza", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Mars One organization's proposal to establish a human colony on Mars is advocated by what famous Astronaut?", "answer": "Buzz Aldrin", "type": "bridge"}