ie written by who ?", "answer": "Joseph Stefano", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What forms the western boundary of the county that WAID is licensed to?", "answer": "the Mississippi River", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which documentary film has a longer running time, The Bomb or Cancer?", "answer": "Cancer", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The 2008\u201309 Premier League (known as the Barclays Premier League for sponsorship reasons) season was the 17th season since the establishment of the Premier League in 1992, Manchester United became champions for the 11th time, defending their crown after winning their tenth Premier League title on the final day of which season that was the 16th since its establishment?", "answer": "2007\u201308 Premier League", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the motorsport team that manufactured the Ligier JS4 founded?", "answer": "1968", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What  American comic book publisher published Dark Night: A True Batman Story is a graphic novel written by Paul Dini?", "answer": "DC Comics", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the director of the 1950 MGM musical film, choreographed by Eugene Loring, in which the actor who played Palmer Cortlandt on the soap opera \"All My Children\" starred?", "answer": "Norman Taurog", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is older, Marion Bartoli or Philipp Petzschner?", "answer": "Philipp Petzschner", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What did the Russian Empire-born composer who is the husband of Vera de Bosset also do ", "answer": "pianist, and conductor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is Cameron Michelle Diaz-Madden's costar in the Ameican action comedy, Knight and Day?", "answer": "Tom Cruise", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Octave Chanute was an American civil engineer and aviation pioneer, born in France, he provided many budding enthusiasts, including The Wright brothers, were two American brothers, inventors, and aviation pioneers 