ountry in December 1914?", "answer": "Egypt", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Terry Ray wrote \u201cHollywood Goes Classical\", which was performed at Dorothy Chandler Pavilion, a hall in which large music center?", "answer": "Los Angeles Music Center", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lyn Breur was speaker of the South Australian House of Assembly for a man who served as Australia's permanent representative to what organization from 2014 through 2016? ", "answer": "Food and Agriculture Organisation and World Food Programme", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lynn DeCoitte was appointed by which American politician who is the eighth and current Governor of Hawaii, in office since 2014?", "answer": "David Ige", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " St. Mary's Ukrainian Catholic Church is located in a country that covers five-eighths of what?", "answer": "the island of Great Britain", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Incendiary: The Willingham Case explores the conviction and execution of what American man who was convicted and executed for the murder of his three young children by arson, on December 23, 1991?", "answer": "Cameron Todd Willingham", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who has directed more films, Manish Gupta or Peter Schamoni?", "answer": "Peter Schamoni", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Titans is an upcoming American television series that will air on an unnamed DC Comics digital service, based on the DC Comics team of the same name, Teagan Croft is which fictional superheroine?", "answer": "Starfire", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Larry Clamage and George Sherman, share which common industry?", "answer": "film", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Don Black, is an English lyricist, he has provided lyrics, for which American composer and conductor?", "answer": "Marvin Frederick Hamlisch", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "To which political party did the Senator belong who, with Representative David McCurdy, authored the Boren-McCurdy intelligence r