ry base of Japan's two major domestic airlines, which one is the largest airline in Japan?", "answer": "All Nippon Airways Co., Ltd.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What field of work do both Gerhard Thiele and L\u00e9opold Eyharts have in common?", "answer": "ESA astronaut", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Maine Women's Hall of Fame was created in 1990 to honor the achievements of women associated with the U.S. state of Maine, which organization displays the hall of fame in its Bennett D. Katz Library, and also hosts the hall of fame online at its website?", "answer": "University of Maine at Augusta (UMA)", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Godfather's Revenge includes a plot that implicates which Robert Duvall-played character in a murder?", "answer": "Tom Hagen", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Jang Joon-hwan and Rudolf Schwarzkogler both from the same country ?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Ron Fricke and Jacques Becker, have which occupation in common?", "answer": "film director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are both Florida Atlantic University and \u0130zmir Institute of Technology in Florida?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who has more education relating to the medical field, John Najarian or Seth Rollins?", "answer": "John S. Najarian", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Known for voicing Captain Hook in the 1953 film \"Peter Pan\", who was the actor who starred in the 1981 show \"American Dream?\"", "answer": "Hans Conried", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Dohonna Malik Scott holds notable wins over a boxer that has been challenged twice by who?", "answer": "Wladimir Klitschko", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What month was the second album performed on the Drowned World Tour released?", "answer": "September", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the league that celebrated its 87th season, in which Club Deportivo Legan\u00e9s participated in?", "answer": "201