n was one of the stars of the English voice-cast of  Kung Fu Magoo born? ", "answer": "May 19, 1965", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Rowbike was invented by the same inventor of a brand of inline skates owned by who?", "answer": "Nordica", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "David J. Pecker is the publisher of what supermarket tabloid?", "answer": "Globe", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Is the William R. Fairchild International Airport or the Chico Municipal Airport in California?", "answer": "Chico Municipal Airport", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Pat Smear joined what American rock band, co-founded by Kurt Cobain, as a touring guitarist?", "answer": "Nirvana", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which director is American, Erin Wiedner or Dodo Abashidze?", "answer": "Erin Wiedner", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Urban Legends: Final Cut stars a Canadian actor who appeared in what 1990 film?", "answer": "Mr. Destiny", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What novel was written by an American writer best known for his postmodernist and metafictional fiction?", "answer": "The Tidewater Tales", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "HMS Dartmouth was wrecked while on a mission to persuade the MacLeans of Duart to sign allegiance to a male monarch, informally known by what name in Northern Ireland and Scotland?", "answer": "\"King Billy\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which actress born November 27, 1985 also performed in 2000's Baby?", "answer": "Alison Pill", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Flexing with Monty stars the actor of what nationality?", "answer": "English", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The lead vocalist for the group The Crabb Family worked with who on the production of the album released on September 18, 2015?", "answer": "Jason Ingram and Paul Mabury", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Von Bondies and Yo La Tengo,  are which genre of a musical group?", "answer": "rock band", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Kylie and which other Jenner 