ctor, screenwriter, actor, and producer who was born in which year?", "answer": "1950", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Gareth Alban Davies is a noted expert on which Spanish poet?", "answer": "Federico Garc\u00eda Lorca.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what British film studio did Herbert Wilcox produce Sorrell and Son?", "answer": "Elstree Studios", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is the airline that AmericanConnection served as a flight connection service brand name for headquartered?", "answer": "Fort Worth, Texas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "To when was the pottery of one of the civilization featured in Age of Empires II: The Conquerors dated", "answer": "around 8000 BC", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The actor Bill Pullman from the Disney movie Tiger Cruise can also be found starring in what movie?", "answer": "\"Spaceballs\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which university is a private university, Lehigh University or Arkansas State University?", "answer": "Lehigh University", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Sabiha G\u00f6k\u00e7en International Airport serves as the hub for what airline headquartered in the Kurtk\u00f6y area of Pendik, Istanbul?", "answer": "Pegasus Airlines", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What does the University of Peradeniya and University of Arkansas have in common? ", "answer": "Grants", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Berkshire Fine Spinning Associates was founded in 1889 and by 1917 the company contained over 260,000 machines used to spin cotton and other fibers whose garriage carried up to how many spindles?", "answer": "1,320", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Professional Footballers' Association Young Player of the Year, is an annual award given to the player aged 23 or under at the start of the season who is adjudged to have been the best of the season in English football, the current holder is which English professional footballer who plays as a midfielder for Premier League club Tottenham Hotspur and the England national team, known commonly as?", "answer": "Dele Alli", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which film has more countries involved, Wonder Woman or A Town Called Panic?", "answer": "A Town Called Panic", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What other occupations did the director of the film that won three awards from the Director's Fortnight program at the 2009 Cannes Film Festival hold?", "answer": "actor, director, screenwriter, editor, costume designer, and voice actor", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is older, Pavel Urysohn or Yuri Matiyasevich?", "answer": "Pavel Samuilovich Urysohn", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which owner of the San Diego Padres baseball team was also married to Joan Kroc?", "answer": "Ray Kroc", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "FC Svetogorets included what Former Russian international association football striker born in 1982", "answer": "Aleksandr Kerzhakov", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which magazine was published first, La Belle Assembl\u00e9e or Mademoiselle?", "answer": "La Belle Assembl\u00e9e", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The 22nd Guldbagge Awards ceremony, presented by the Swedish Film Institute, honored the best Swedish films of 1986, The Sacrifice, is a 1986 Swedish film, directed by who?", "answer": "Andrei Tarkovsky", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was this political group called had a series of armed conflicts and political machinations against Parliamentarians, which is often a subject in Partizan Press?", "answer": "Royalists", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The show Famous, Rich and Hungry with Rachel Johnson as one of the people experiencing food poverty has been compared to what celebrity version?", "answer": "\"Benefits Street\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Ningguo and Quanzhou in the same country?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which film is older, The Tillman Story or the Mysterious Castles of Clay?", "answer": "Mysterio