can black comedy neo-noir crime film producted by Harvey Weinstein?", "answer": "Quentin Tarantino", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Daniel Massey starred in The Queen's Guards alongside which actor, who was once regarded as the natural successor to Laurence Olivier?", "answer": "Robert Stephens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2009 drama film Tanner Hall was written and directed by which Italian-American director and writer born in 1968?", "answer": "Francesca Gregorini", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What do both Lincoln Steffens and Tom Clancy have in common?", "answer": "published", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What year did the Los Angeles Clippers and Memphis Grizzlies face off, resulting in the Los Angeles Clippers to lose their first-round series in six games?", "answer": "2012\u201313", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What NCAA Division I men's basketball team from Stillwater, Oklahoma once had Kyle Keller as an assistant coach?", "answer": "Oklahoma State Cowboys", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born first, Guy Gavriel Kay or Joanne Harris?", "answer": "Guy Gavriel Kay", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Bob Mould and Wax on Radio musical artists from Great Britain?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are both Maurice Ravel and Ambroise Thomas French composers?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "what does De Zoeker, Zaandam and Flax have in common?", "answer": "linseed", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The actress that played the title character on the sitcom \"Murphy Brown\" stars with Gene Hackman in a 1977 thriller film based on a novel by what author?", "answer": "Adam Kennedy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Among John Malkovich's 70+ film roles is which 1996 crime thriller with an ensemble cast led by Nick Nolte and Jennifer Connelly?", "answer": "Mulholland Falls", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Have Bobby Gillespie and John Bush both been members of a band?", "answer":