ich sea ?", "answer": "the Mediterranean Sea", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birthdate of this Soviet Jewish aircraft designer, who designed many of the famous MiG military aircraft, in partnership with Artem Mikoyan? ", "answer": "12 January 1893", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the Canadian actress and singer, who starred in Life Under Water, born?", "answer": "June 2, 1950", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the nickname of Retired Spanish football and youger brother of tennis player Toni Nadal?", "answer": "The Beast", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "For which team does the older brother of Jonas Hummels play ? ", "answer": "Bayern Munich", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which opera was performed first, The Midsummer Marriage or Hans Heiling?", "answer": "Hans Heiling", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What was the release date of the film that starred Amanda Bynes and Nita Mistry?", "answer": "April 4, 2003", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the nickname for the Football Club that Matt Crouch was recruited by?", "answer": "the Crows", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Frank Oz and Andrew Davis both puppeteers?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was lead singer of the song \"Why Does It Shake?\"", "answer": "Joe Casey", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Professional Basketball Club LLC is an investment group headed by who, which American businessman and chairman of the Professional Basketball Club LLC, the ownership group of the Oklahoma City Thunder, an NBA franchise formerly known as the Seattle SuperSonics?", "answer": "Clayton Ike Bennett", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Tritonia and Kosteletzkya both types of plants?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": " Tobias Vincent \"Tobey\" Maguire is known for playing the title character in Sam Raimi's 2007 film based on what fictional Marvel Comics comic book?", "answer": "Spider-Man 3", "type": "bridge"}, {"questi