fe\u00f3r J\u00fal\u00edus \"Thor\" Bj\u00f6rnsson, is an Icelandic professional strongman, actor, and former professional basketball player, he plays which fictional character in the \"A Song of Ice and Fire\" series of fantasy novels by American author George R. R. Martin, and its television adaptation \"Game of Thrones\"?", "answer": "Gregor Clegane", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Gravity Kills and Deas Vail rock bands?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In regards to the gentleman who was a clerk for the Supreme Court Justice who died in April of 2002, who were his two first cousins?", "answer": "Mo Udall and Stewart Udall", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the occupation of a Kenyan amateur boxer who won silver at the 2010 Commonwealth Games and a bronze medal in Glasgow, Scotland, from 25 July to 2 August at the Scottish Exhibition and Conference ?", "answer": "police officer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who, were they alive today, would be older: Christoph Schlingensief or Will Finn?", "answer": "Will Finn", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In what Prince of Orange's parliament did Arthur Chichester sit?", "answer": "William III", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the Chinese name of the Tibetan tenor that performs with a New York-based entertainment company that translates its name as \"the beauty of devine beings dancing\"?", "answer": "Yuan Qu", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the name of the stadium replaced by the current stadium that is adjacent to the Ridgely's Delight historic residential neighborhood? ", "answer": "Memorial Stadium", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Benjamin Britten and Claude Debussy music composers ? ", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Jane Chance has been the professor emeritus in English at Rice University, a title named after which American banker and industrialist?", "answer": "Andrew William Mellon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question"