ad of the criminal organziation?", "answer": "during the 1980s and 1990s", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which artist who has used the services of Rob Persaud was also part of The Saturdays?", "answer": "Mollie King", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Der Freisch\u00fctz and Der Barbier von Bagdad operas?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "This New Zealand comedian, actor, musician and producer best known for the Flight of the Conchords along with Jemaine Clement contributed to this film written by Jason Segel and Nicholas Stoller and starring Amy Adams, which is directed by whom?", "answer": "James Bobin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which tennis player Anna-Lena Gr\u00f6nefeld or Mats Wilander turned professional first ?", "answer": "Mats Wilander", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What was the population of the city east of Guist Creek Lake in 2010?", "answer": "14,045", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Sukhoi/HAL Fifth Generation Fighter Aircraft is a derivative of another Russian plane thats international name is what?", "answer": "T-50", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "which  Croatian-Canadian businessman offers Cinnaholic  $200,000 ", "answer": "Robert Herjavec", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Linhai and Pingquan, are located in which country?", "answer": "China", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Unnai Charanadaindhen features a soundtrack by which Guinness World Record holder for having the most songs recorded?", "answer": "Sripathi Panditaradhyula Balasubrahmanyam", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What singer who was a member of the Buckaroos wrote a song that peaked at number 2 on the U.S. \"Billboard\" Hot Country Singles chart?", "answer": "Buck Owens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Along with Barrow Hematite Steel Company Limited, what was the other major target of the Barrow Blitz?", "answer": "VSEL shipyard", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The most famous and often parodied poem by Joyce Kilmer