ication did albums by performers Carl Hancock Rux and Eleanora Fagan appear?", "answer": "Great Black Music", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Jos\u00e9 M\u00e1rio Sperry, a Brazilian heavyweight mixed martial artist, trained a retired Brazilian mixed martial artist who in submission wrestling, he holds an undefeated record of what?", "answer": "13-0", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what district of Vienna is the hotel Elisabeth G\u00fcrtler-Mauthner manages?", "answer": "Innere Stadt first district", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Value Alliance comprises seven Asia-Pacific airlines such as which Philippine low-cost airline based on the grounds of Ninoy Aquino International Airport (NAIA Terminal 3), Pasay City, Metro Manila, in the Philippines?", "answer": "Cebu Pacific", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Z\u00f6e Lucker played Carol Barry in \"Waterloo Road, broadcast on what network?", "answer": "broadcast on BBC One", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which occured first, the Battle of Iwo Jima or the Battle of Belleau Wood", "answer": "Battle of Belleau Wood", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which documentary included a ship nicknamed \"Mighty Mo\"?", "answer": "Appointment in Tokyo", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "While the Editors are an English rock band, the Squirrel Nut Zippers are what type of band?", "answer": "American swing band", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Get Animated is a program block on the Disney Channel in the United States, consisting of Saturday morning cartoons, it aired shows like Gravity Falls, an American animated television series, produced by Disney Television Animation originally for what?", "answer": "Disney Channel", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What do Trey Parker and Pietro Germi have in common?", "answer": "actor", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the birth date of this Austrialian entrepeneur who owned with his wife an Australia-wide chain of retail stores that sold consumer electronics goods