itoe?", "answer": "Alan Sillitoe", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What New York-based graphic designer has a client base which includes the Frank Lloyd Wright Foundation housed at Taliesin West?", "answer": "Bonnie Siegler", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who wrote the song which was ahead of \"Purple Rain on the charts in 1984?", "answer": "George Michael.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Move You\" is a song by the winner of the inaugural season of what television series?", "answer": "American Idol", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what film did Stephen Dunham star alongside Jane Fonda?", "answer": "Monster-in-Law", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "which scheduled monument within the town of Ellon, Aberdeenshire.did  Michaela Reid moved into", "answer": "Ellon Castle", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What country of origin does A Walk on the Moon and Diane Lane have in common?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What canadian reality television series features Drew Scott and airs on HGTV in the United States?", "answer": "Property Brothers", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which midfielder won the South American Footballer of the Year award?", "answer": "Juan Sebasti\u00e1n Ver\u00f3n", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Railroad Model Craftsman and Mother Jones, are of which nationality?", "answer": "American", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "One of David Kaye's roles was to play several characters in what animated television series that was designed to capitalize on the 2012 film, \"The Avengers\"?", "answer": "Avengers Assemble", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What do both Michael Kiske and Terry McBride have in common?", "answer": "singer", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "America: Imagine the World Without Her is a film by a political commentator who was born on what year ?", "answer": "1961", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the mother of Theodosia Burr Alston born?", "answer": "1746", "type": 