 the South Atlantic was made by the Portuguese naval aviators Gago Coutinho and Sacadura Cabral in which year, to mark the centennial of Brazil's independence, although the North Atlantic had already been traversed in a non-stop flight by John Alcock and Arthur Brown in 1919, Coutinho and Cabral's flight remains notable as a milestone in transatlantic aviation, and for its use of new technologies such as the artificial horizon?", "answer": "1922", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Mike Perry is known for the single that was released as a download in Sweden on what date?", "answer": "15 April 2016", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the guitarist born, who re-recorded the bass guitar for the album \"True Norwegian Black Metal \u2013 Live in Grieghallen\" by the band Gorgoroth?", "answer": "18 June 1972", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The star of the film \"What Happened to Jones\" was once a champion in what amateur sport?", "answer": "boxing", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What former member of the band Humble Pie guest starred on The Simpsons episode \"Homerpalooza\"?", "answer": "Peter Frampton", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Life Screams is an album by the singer from what Florida city?", "answer": "Homestead", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what neighborhood of Upper Manhattan, New York City, does the Second Avenue Line of the New York City Subway border?", "answer": "East Harlem", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Disneyland show was adapted into a Christmas version, which appeared in the California and Florida parks from 1984?", "answer": "Country Bear Jamboree", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Whose films became famous earlier, George King or Mira Nair?", "answer": "George King", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which is a film critic, Rod Lurie or Stanley Kramer?", "answer": "Rod Lurie", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In 1995 Peter Rasmussen played association football for the Danish team located in what city?", "answer":