ared in a series created by Larry David?", "answer": "Karen Maruyama", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were George Tzavellas and Max Linder both directors and screenwriters?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What was the population in 2016 of the county in which North Brunswick Township Public Schools is in?", "answer": "837,073", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How long has the wife of Michael Coutts-Trotter been a member of Parliament?", "answer": "been the Member of Parliament for Sydney since 1998,", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Carl Bar\u00e2t and Dan Swan\u00f6 both musicians?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Duchess of Malfi was composed by the artist of what nationality?", "answer": "English", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Did Colour Genie and NEC PC-100 both originate in the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Do Rika Hiraki and Mara Santangelo come from the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was the older brother of person whose guard formed the French Royal Guard?", "answer": "Napoleon I, Emperor of the French", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Cotai Arena is an indoor arena, located on the premises of the seventh-largest building in the world by what?", "answer": "floor area", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is older, Fernando Meirelles or John Irvin?", "answer": "John Irvin", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Graeme Strachan and Dan Andriano, have which mutual occupations?", "answer": "singer, songwriter", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which Puerto Rican boxer did Kenny Lane fight for a title?", "answer": "Carlos Ortiz", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which National Park is the tenth most visited national park in Spain: Atlantic Islands of Galicia National Park or Teide National Park? ", "answer": "Atlantic Islands of Galicia National Park", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "When was the album that 