ley v United Kingdom", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the American comedian who created Friars Club of Beverly Hills born? ", "answer": "July 12, 1908", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Richard Jay \"Rich\" Franklin II, is an American retired mixed martial artist who competed in Ultimate Fighting Championship, as of June 2014, Franklin was announced as a Vice President of which Singapore-based mixed martial arts (MMA) promotion which was launched on 14 July 2011 by multimillionaire entrepreneur Chatri Sityodtong and former ESPN Star Sports senior executive Victor Cui?", "answer": "ONE Championship", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is the newest film, Bon Voyage! or Underdog?", "answer": "Underdog", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Of Jeremy Bates and Daniela Hantuchov\u00e1 who gained prominence and achieved high peak at an earlier stage of sports career?", "answer": "Daniela Hantuchov\u00e1", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which American singer-songwriter lip-synched lyrics for Elton John?", "answer": "Justin Timberlake", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which player's career, drafted in the same year as Rich Manning, was derailed by a car accident?", "answer": "Bobby Hurley", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is a national park that surrounds a mountain in the Tweed Range?", "answer": "South Wales", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What opera was composed by an english composer who was born on the 12th of October 1872 and died on the 26th of August 1958?", "answer": "\"Sir John in Love\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Worn throughout the Caribbean region, notably in Cuba and Jamaica as wedding attire, what upper-body form does the guayabera take for men?", "answer": "bush jacket", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is a species in southern Africa, Clytostoma or Zantedeschia aethiopica?", "answer": "Zantedeschia aethiopica", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which band has more founder, White Magic or Sound Team?", "answe