urrent champion of NBA All-Star Weekend Skills Challenge was drafted in which year?", "answer": "2015", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "This host of the 2016 MBC Entertainment awards starred in \"Cheese in the Trap\".", "answer": "Lee Sung-kyung", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Albert Lee Ueltschi is considered the father of modern flight training and was once personal pilot to Juan Trippe and an associate of which famous person?", "answer": "Charles Lindbergh", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The actress that leads the tv program Spokoynoy nochi, malyshi! appears in a 2010 film directed by who?", "answer": "Nikita Mikhalkov", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Tim McIlrath and Scott Weiland of the same nationality?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Mark Duckens first attended which third-largest university in Kansas?", "answer": "Wichita State University", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Christian Nicholas Stadil is a Danish executive and chairman of Hummel International, based in what country?", "answer": "Denmark", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What do Sigmund J\u00e4hn and Piers Sellers have in common?", "answer": "astronaut", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Gentle Storm, is a Dutch musical project by which singer and lyricist, and composer and musician Arjen Anthony Lucassen, a Dutch singer, songwriter, multi-instrumentalist musician and producer?", "answer": "Anneke van Giersbergen", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What vitamin is David P. Ballou known for studying?", "answer": "Vitamin B", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Sisters stars a Canadian-American actor who is known for his role as Will Truman in what sitcom?", "answer": "Will & Grace", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What season was it for 2004 American Football League when Chris Judd won the 2004 Brownlow Medal?", "answer": "108th", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "which american investigative journalist is noted for her speculations that the U.S. government is colluding with aliens and the creator of the program  \"The UFO Report: Sightings\"?", "answer": "Linda Moulton Howe", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What election did Varaprasad Rao Velagapalli win to constitute the 16th Lok Sabha, electing members of parliament for all 543 parliamentary constituencies of India?  ", "answer": "Indian general election, 2014", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was a singer as well as an actor, Nam Woo-hyun or Boy George?", "answer": "Nam Woo-hyun", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who has received more Academy Awards?Asghar Farhadi or Carlos Saldanha?", "answer": "Asghar Farhadi", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Konstantinos Barbarousis and Nikolaos Michaloliakos are connect by their involvement in what group? ", "answer": "Golden Dawn", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Priceless includes production from a DJ who has worked with what artist whose first album was \"Savage Dreams\"?", "answer": "Baby Bash", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Question: Who has written more screenplays, Michael Gordon or B. Reeves Eason?", "answer": "B. Reeves Eason", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the nickname of the computer produced in 1948 by the Royal Society Computing Machine Laboratory, established by Max Newman?", "answer": "Baby", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The family that James Roosevelt was a part of was descended from what nationality of immigrants?", "answer": "Dutch", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what 1988 American Christmas comedy film did Reina King play as the oldest daughter?", "answer": "Scrooged", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which magazine is older, V or Collier's?", "answer": "Collier's", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In between Date palm and Jeffersonia which one was formerly grouped in genus \"Podophyllum\"?", "answer": "Jeffersonia", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Arakimentari and Marlene, films of which genre?", "answer": "documentary", "type": "comparison"}, {"que