y ?", "answer": "Essex County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Galicia Hoxe was a newspaper from what capital of Galicia?", "answer": "Santiago de Compostela", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Isaac Slade and Walt Aldridge engineers?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which Australian rock journalist and critic wrote the compendium of notable popular recordings which he considers are \"the great songs of all time\", including one by the American singer songwriter whose debut album was \"Songs in A Minor\"?", "answer": "Toby Creswell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Orlando Magic can boast which host of NBA Inside Stuff as a former player?", "answer": "Grant Henry Hill", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Saveloy is said to originate from the Latin \"cerebrus\" which is a sausage produced where?", "answer": "produced in Switzerland, France (especially Alsace and Lyon) and parts of Germany", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the director of the 2004 comedy film in which the actor who played the role of Spencer Olchin in the sitcom \"The King of Queens\" made a cameo appearance?", "answer": "David M. Rosenthal", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What super-regional shopping mall located in north Austin, Texas, is served by the Lakeline Capital MetroRail, commuter rail station?", "answer": "Lakeline Mall", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "For which book retailer based out of Ann Arbor, Michigan was Howard Lorber on the Board of Directors?", "answer": "Borders Group Inc.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Toshiko Koshijima and Guy Chadwick both responsible for writing the majority of their respective bands material?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What year was the new quarterback for the 2013 Oakland Raiders born?", "answer": "1989", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Elizabeth at 90: A Family Portrait is narrated by the longest-serving heir apparent in what?", "answer": "British history", "type": "bridge