}, {"question": "In the Basement and National Bird, are of which genre?", "answer": "documentary", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was the other developer with Hawk Ostby who developed the American science fiction television series in which Kevin Hanchard had his role as Inspector Sematimba?", "answer": "Mark Fergus", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Wilfred Noy and Malcolm St. Clair were both directors?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "A dutch electronic music trio helped the tenth studio album of what American nu metal band?", "answer": "Korn", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Antti Hulkko is most famous for his role in a Finnish rock band formed in 1979, why did this band break up?", "answer": "drummer Nicholas \"Razzle\" Dingley had died", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is a 2010 3D documentary film by Werner Herzog about the Chauvet Cave in southern France, War/Dance or Cave of Forgotten Dreams?", "answer": "Cave of Forgotten Dreams", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is the father of Aage Bohr and son of Christian Bohr?", "answer": "Niels Bohr", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Anglo-Fran\u00e7ais de Petite V\u00e9nerie and Hawaiian Poi Dog extinct breeds of dogs?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What honor did the man for whom the USS \"Kauffman\" was named after receive?", "answer": "the Navy Cross", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was a book written by the man who studied the surface rupture caused by the 1855 Wairarapa earthquake?", "answer": "\"Principles of Geology\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " The Duchy of Holstein was established by a Scandinavian monarch under what union?", "answer": "Kalmar Union", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are \"Lady Macbeth of the Mtsensk District\" and \"Iphig\u00e9nie en Tauride\" both operas?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who won more doubles titles, Larisa Neiland or David Adams?", "answer": "Larisa Savche