h shared occupation?", "answer": "film director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Kirk Fell is situated near what mountain that has a height of 892 metres?", "answer": "Pillar", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2017 Cronulla-Sutherlan Sharks Season was captained by an Australian born in what year?", "answer": "1981", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the book based on the life of Kermit Washington's life after he ended Rudy Tomjanovich's playing career?", "answer": "The Breaks of the Game", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which year was this slasher film starring Chad Allen and the American actor, singer, and game show host from \"Brotherly Love\" released?", "answer": "2001", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Pierre Wom\u00e9 and Christian Poulsen shared which athletic profession?", "answer": "footballer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what county did Graham Richard serve as mayor from 2000-2008?", "answer": "Allen County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Memphis Belle starred this man who was born on September 11, 1967", "answer": "Harry Connick Jr.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birthday of the first manager for Leeds United F.C. in the 2007-08 season?", "answer": "16 December 1966", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Aew both Kodiak Airport and Rickenbacker International Airport located in Ohio?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Air Marshal John William \"Jake\" Newham, is a retired senior commander of the Royal Australian Air Force (RAAF), he took charge of No. 3 Squadron in 1967, when it re-equipped with what, which family of single-seat, single-engine, fighter aircraft developed and manufactured by French aircraft company Dassault Aviation?", "answer": "Dassault Mirage III", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Whate state is CraveOnline based out of?", "answer": "California", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Admiral Sir John David Luce & Bar took part in which Allied attack on the German-oc