d first studio album by electronic music project Moderat, consisting of Modeselektor and a German electronic musician who was previously the co-owner of what?", "answer": "Shitkatapult records", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lakeview, Alabama is located atop what part of the southern tip of the Appalachians?", "answer": "Sand Mountain", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the tenth studio album of Sandra Ann Lauer? ", "answer": "Stay in Touch", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of music hails from a 25600 acre cotton plantation and sawmill in Mississippi which was built from scratch by Will Dockery and home to Charley Patton?", "answer": "Delta blues", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who painted the wife of King Philip IV of Spain in 1635?", "answer": "Vel\u00e1zquez", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who composed the symphony dedicated to the 1st Viscount St Alban?", "answer": "Alan Hovhaness", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bob Basset has been published in the art magazine that is a sister publication to what other magazine?", "answer": "Fortean Times", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which battle did Friedrich Bertram Sixt von Armin participate in from July to November 1917?", "answer": "Battle of Passchendaele", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What record label released the album containing \"All Toorrow's Parties\"?", "answer": "Verve Records", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What American novelist and young-adult and children's writer mentioned Middleborough in her short story \"Saint Helene\"?", "answer": "Alice Hoffman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "We All Go a Little Mad Sometimes was an episode from which American supernatural drama?", "answer": "The Vampire Diaries", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Fever Pitch stars the actor who was a cast member on which sketch program?", "answer": "Saturday Night Live", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What multinational banking and financial services corporation sponsored the 20