: "Archduke Charles of Austria, Duke of Teschen", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is younger, George Piranian or Colton Ford?", "answer": "Colton Ford", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "How many Tony Awards have been won by Al Isarael's co-star in \"Carlito's Way\"?", "answer": "two", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which role the Swedish professional ice hockey plays who is currently playing for a professional ice hockey team based in Edmonton, Alberta?", "answer": "defenceman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the release date of Seal's album that was produced by the Chairman of Verve Records from 2012 to 2016?", "answer": "20 September 2010", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which former tennis player played for the United States, Iv\u00e1n Molina or Alex O'Brien?", "answer": "Alex O'Brien", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Five Style (a name taken from a martial arts technique called \"Five Style Fist\"), also known as 5ive Style, is a Chicago-based funk/jam quartet, members were major players of the 1990s Chicago music scene and included which American alternative rock band based in Chicago, Illinois?", "answer": "Wilco", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which has more species Lamium or Colletia?", "answer": "Lamium", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What record label are the duo of Chad Cisneros and David Reed associated with?", "answer": "Mainstage Music", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Compiler was originally published in a magazine first issued when? ", "answer": "January 25, 1986", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Stricken\" is a song by the American heavy metal band Disturbed, themusical video for the song was filmed in an abandoned hospital in which some scenes from the horror film \"A Nightmare on Elm Street\", released in which year, were filmed?", "answer": "1984", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 1988 Stanley Cup playoffs were won by a team who play in what division of the Western Conference?", "answer": "Pacific