 founded in what year?", "answer": "1878", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 127th SS-Standarte was the last regiment established by the Nazis during which war?", "answer": "World War II", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What female character appeared in a 1981 fantasy film directed by Matthew Robbins?", "answer": "Valerian", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What German film director directed a 1920 silent film considered to be lost? ", "answer": "Friedrich Wilhelm \"F. W.\" Murnau", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "School of Nuclear and Allied Sciences is located at the college in what Accra village?", "answer": "Kwabenya", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is Swedish rock star, Max Carl or Anders Frid\u00e9n?", "answer": "Anders Frid\u00e9n", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "This town with a population of 2,216 as of 2010 is home to a fortification at the mouth of what river?", "answer": "Kennebec River", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "what does Clianthus and Ceratonia have in common?", "answer": "flowering", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Henri de Dreux commemorated by a window in a catherdral that replaced an older church destroyed by fire in what year?", "answer": "1211", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ardath is the unincorporated community located on what major road, along the \"North America's Railroad\", Delisle-Tichfield Junction stub?", "answer": "Highway 654", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what country was Alfred Schnittke's Nagasaki given its public premiere?", "answer": "South Africa", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What village of population 27,253 is located in the 4th District of New York?", "answer": "Lindenhurst", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What gun developed in Nazi Germany and used in WWII did the M56 submachine gun clone?", "answer": "MP 40", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "1897\u201398 season was the fourth in the history of the Southern League in which a professional association football club, who plays in w