ormed in 1965, in Hanover by who?", "answer": "Rudolf Schenker", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Did Stephen Vincent Ben\u00e9t and Robert Desnos have the same nationality ?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which band was formed first Lit or Every Avenue?", "answer": "Lit", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In which city, the largest coastal city in northern China, can Helcystogramma perelegans be found?", "answer": "Tianjin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Georgina Campbell won the British Academy Television Award for Best Actress in 2015 for her role along side which actor ?", "answer": "Royce Pierreson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both The Darling Buds and Shinedown from the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Was the film \"Boogie\" based on the Argentine character Bookie directed by Gustavo Cova or was \"A Town Called Panic\" a 2009 internationally co-produced stop-motion animated adventure fantasy comedy family film directed by Gustavo Cova?", "answer": "Boogie", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Were Edwin Greenwood and Andrew Lau Wai-Keung both directors?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What year did the recorder of Young Man Mose die?", "answer": "2016", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what series did one of America's most successful living authors call Frank C. Barnes House haunted?", "answer": "Ramona Quimby series", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What state capital did Samuel Holyoke die in?", "answer": "Concord, New Hampshire", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are GO and Midwest Living both regional publications?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Lillian Sefton Dodge Estate is located in what village in Nassau County, New York?", "answer": "Mill Neck", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When did the husband of Rufina Ivanovna Pukhova die?", "answer": "11 May 1988", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The best selling beer in Hong Kong 