": "from 1611 to 1632", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the lead vocalist of the alternative rock band Garbage, Shirley Manson or Carol Decker?", "answer": "Shirley Ann Manson", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Where did the documentary about the life of the first woman elected to serve as chief of the Cherokee Nation premier?", "answer": "Los Angeles Film Festival", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "During what years was Jeff Brohm the head coach at Western Kentucky University?", "answer": "head coach at Western Kentucky University from 2014\u20132016.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the first single released from Rufus Wainwright's fifth studio album?", "answer": "Going to a Town", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Bill Leeb and Brad Delp from the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which National Football League team was coached by the same coach from the winning team in The Kick?", "answer": "Dallas Cowboys", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Palm Aire is now part of a city that is part of which metropolitan area?", "answer": "Miami", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who created the TV series in which Shae D'Lyn plays the role of Carolyn Rothstein ?", "answer": "Terence Winter", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the singer that recorded \"Should've Been Us\" born?", "answer": "December 14, 1992", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the actor that voiced a character in Zootopia, and also has been nominated for four Golden Globe awards for Best Actor?", "answer": "Idris Elba", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How long is the river that Lochmere Archeological District located on?", "answer": "10.5 mi", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Chavano Rainier was named MVP at what tournament held in Honolulu, Hawaii? ", "answer": "2015 Diamond Head Classic", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What footballer born October 1988 is featured on the cover of Dream League Soccer?", "answer": "Diego Costa", "type