ost famous single from the 1994 album \"No, No, No\"?", "answer": "You Don't Love Me", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Tommy Lee Jones and Peter Szewczyk of the same nationality?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What nickname, first mentioned in a 1985 \"New York\" magazine article, is associated with the term \"Brit Pack\"?", "answer": "The Brat Pack", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Nick Russell played basketball in which NCAA Division I conference?", "answer": "Big 12", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On what channel did the 2009 South Korean television series starring the actress who first gained attention for her 2008 supporting role as a gisaeng in \"Painter of the Wind, air?", "answer": "KBS2", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Patricia Blair played Lou Mallory on the ABC western series \"The Rifleman\", in which she appeared in 22 episodes with Chuck Connors, best known for his five-year role as what character in the highly rated ABC series \"The Rifleman\" (1958\u201363)?", "answer": "Lucas McCain", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Is Dipteris or Deuterocohnia native to more regions?", "answer": "Dipteris", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Atomic Blonde is a 2017 American action spy thriller film that stars a Scottish actor who made his acting debut in what movie?", "answer": "The Near Room", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of media does Everyone's Hero and 20th Century Fox have in common?", "answer": "Film", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the larger conflict surrounding the revolt led by Ralph de Gael?", "answer": "Norman Conquest", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What country of origin does The Spitfire Grill and Gailard Sartain have in common?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "During the 2005 All-Pacific-10 Conference season, the  Pat Tillman Pac-10 Co-Defensive Players of the Year award was given to Dale Robinson and a man that current plays for what NFL team?", "answer": "D