 designer, of which nationality?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lewis Milestone and Aaron Katz, are both of which nationality?", "answer": "American", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What artist did Nick Huff Barili interview who was born on July 6, 1979?", "answer": "Kevin Hart", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which person is the son of Tariq Alam who also plays Cricket for Pakistan?", "answer": "Fawad Alam", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which band Jesus Jones or Morcheeba was formed first ?", "answer": "Jesus Jones", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "This Could be Heaven is a soundtrack for what romantic comedy-drama film directed by Brett Ratner?", "answer": "The Family Man", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is from farther north, A-ha or Sound Team?", "answer": "A-ha", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Ben Agajanian and Andy Bakjian, were in the sports industry?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Jennifer Teege's father was the cammandant of what concentration camp?", "answer": "Krak\u00f3w-P\u0142asz\u00f3w", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Thomas Bartley (1908\u20131964) was a Test match umpire, He stood in first class cricket from 1948 to 1960 and officiated in 6 home tests against Pakistan, The Pakistan national cricket team, are popularly referred to as what?", "answer": "Shaheens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Nadia Forde, is an Irish model, singer and actress of Italian descent, she participated in the fourteenth series of the hit ITV show \"I'm a Celebrity...Get Me Out of Here!\", starting on which date?", "answer": "16 November 2014", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How man species are there of the bird that is the nickname of De Papegaai?", "answer": "393", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What war did the author of \"The Road Back\" fight in?", "answer": "World War I", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On which peninsula is this British Overseas Territory located, whose Defence p