der, Angelina Jolie or Michael Anderson? ", "answer": "Michael Joseph Anderson, Sr. (born 30 January 1920)", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": " UFC Fight Night: Silva vs. Irvin was held at a resort that has how many rooms and suites?", "answer": "703", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Joseph Haslag is the Chair in Economics at the university whose post is named after the businessman who was CEO of what company?", "answer": "Enron Corporation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the fairy tale of which the plot of \"Tears Were Falling\" can be viewed as a modern interpretation first published?", "answer": "1844", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed a 2016 action comedy drama film starring a South Korean actor and singer who first gained widespread fame in Korea and parts of Asia with his role as Gu Jun-pyo in \"Boys Over Flowers\"?", "answer": "Shin Terra", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which female celebrity who popularized the \"Whale Tale\" was in a reality TV show called \"The Simple Life\"?", "answer": "Paris Hilton", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born earlier, Johnny Bonnel or Ric Ocasek?", "answer": "Ric Ocasek", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Back to the Future will include hits Johnny B. Goode and what other?", "answer": "The Power of Love", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What businessman and founder of Las Vegas Sands corporation has had buildings designed by Paul Steelman?", "answer": "Sheldon Adelson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Desmia ploralis is found in what country in Central America that is a representative democracy, and whose capital and largest sity is Nueva Guatemala de la Asuncion?", "answer": "Guatemala", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Abdurahman Enad, is a Qatari footballer, Qatar, officially the State of Qatar, is a sovereign country located in which Western continent?", "answer": "Asia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Lam Research Corporation and Charter Communications are both what