ring Judi Dench and Billy Connolly which has the sequel 'Victoria & Abdul' a 2017 biographical comedy-drama film?", "answer": "Mrs Brown", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which of the original Assassin to \"The Assassins\" was best known as one half of the tag team?", "answer": "Jody Hamilton", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who starred in both Gnomeo and Juliet and My Summer of Love?", "answer": "Emily Blunt", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Dr. Demento 20th Anniversary Collection contains a song by what singer who is known for his humorous songs that make light of popular culture and often parody specific songs by contemporary musical acts?", "answer": "Alfred Matthew \"Weird Al\" Yankovic", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 1977 Tennessee Volunteers were led by which former football player as coach?", "answer": "John Terrill Majors", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Comparison between Morina and Tradescantia?", "answer": "French physician and botanist", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "\"The Injury\" was one of how many episodes that season?", "answer": "22", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Roberta Bergersen was the 52nd overall NBA draft pick, in what city?", "answer": "Washington, D.C.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Madhusudhan Rao is an actor who appeared in what 2016 action fantasy horror comedy film?", "answer": "Kaashmora", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Manuel Orantes and Hank Pfister both former tennis players ?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Whom was the sister of a prominent figure in the Restoration court and an influential friend of Queen Anne of Great Britain?", "answer": "Sarah Churchill, Duchess of Marlborough", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who designed more movie sets, Harry Lachman or James P. Hogan?", "answer": "Harry B. Lachman", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is formed through a reaction of (CH)C(CHOH) and Carbonyl Chloride?", "answer": "Polycarbonate", "type": "bridge"}, {"question