hat was made?", "answer": "railway air brake", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which state is the parent company of Boston Express based out of?", "answer": "New Hampshire", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the lyricist of \"Ghar Ka Chirag\" remembered as?", "answer": "the one who brought Urdu literature to Indian motion pictures", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Fading\" is a song by Barbadian recording artist Rihanna, some critics also compared it to one of Rihanna's previous singles, \"Take A Bow\", released in which year?", "answer": "2008", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bilawal is a raga and basic \"thaat\" (musical mode) in Hindustani classical music, it is equivalent to which r\u0101ga in Carnatic music?", "answer": "Dheerasankarabharanam", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What \"Full House\" actor co-wrote an album released in September 2012?", "answer": "John Phillip Stamos", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What are the policies and theories of this Turkish army officer and revolutionary, whose mansion is called Yalova Atat\u00fcrk Mansion, known as?", "answer": "Kemalism", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Comparison between Dashboard Confessional and Escanaba Firing Line?", "answer": "rock band", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which re-issued song did Taylor Swift produce with Nathan Chapman and Dann Huff?", "answer": "Begin Again", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What do Mr Lordi and Mike Score have in common?", "answer": "musician", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are James Lee Burke and Max Jacob both writers ?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What American actor who was born on February 12, 1968 will be featured in the twelfth installment in the \"X-Men\" film series?", "answer": "Josh Brolin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birth date of this Tyrolean mountaineer, agricultural scientist, geographer, and cartographer who played the husband of Lhak[a Tsamchoe in Seven Years in TIbet?", 