n is based on the heart of the Las Vegas\u2013Paradise-Henderson, NV MSA?", "answer": "Ariann Black", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Ontronik Khachaturian and Siouxsie Sioux singers and producers?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "A Bayou Legend is an American opera composed by William Grant Still, was an American composer, who composed more than 150 works, including five symphonies and eight operas, with a libretto by his wife and frequent collaborator, who?", "answer": "Verna Arvey", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Jeremy Dawson was a film producer who was nominatd for an Academy Award for what 2014 comedy film?", "answer": "The Grand Budapest Hotel", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which railway is on Hill Street?", "answer": "Angels Flight", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which county is the city in which Ryan McGarry was born ?", "answer": "Cook County.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which genus has more species Persea or Crocus ?", "answer": "Persea", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What city does Faena Arts Center and Alan Faena have in common?", "answer": "Buenos Aires", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Joint is a showroom located in a town with what population as of the 2010 census?", "answer": "223,167", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year did the genre of opera in which Josef Myslive\u010dek contributed to eventually end?", "answer": "1770", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "White Farm Equipment is a brand of agricultural machinery, now discontinued except for planter, and owned by AGCO, AGCO Corporation is an American agricultural equipment manufacturer based in Duluth, Georgia, in which country?", "answer": "United States", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which company operates in the US and is exclusively e-commerce?", "answer": "Wayfair", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "John Finnegan voiced the character Warren T. Rat is a film directed by a man that is the older brother of what illustrator?