yband, Dani Filth or Takahiro Moriuchi?", "answer": "Takahiro Moriuchi", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Streptosolen and Iresine both types of flowering plants?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which movie starring Julia Chantrey was directed by Andy Muschietti?", "answer": "Mama", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of vegetation does Biarum and Magnolia have in common?", "answer": "plant", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "After was an episode of The Walking Dead written by the comic book writer who also created what other series?", "answer": "Invincible", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What heisman tropy winner from Wisconsin was nicknamed \"The Iron Horse\"?", "answer": "Alan Ameche", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On what date did the 1980 eruption of Mount St. Helens, in which \"Crater Glacier\" was formed, occur?", "answer": "May 18, 1980", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Subak and Caral originated from the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the seat of the county that includes the mountain Kearsarge North?", "answer": "Ossipee", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What corporation designed a supersonic light fighter family, initially designed in the late 1950s use in a two-year program that was a joint effort between NASA's Langley Research Center, Dryden Flight Research Center at Edwards Air Force Base, California and Northrop Grumman?", "answer": "Northrop Corporation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Joe Cornish made his directorial debut in the comedy film that starred whom?", "answer": "John Boyega, Nick Frost, Jodie Whittaker and Luke Treadaway", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which rapper sings Runnin' From tha Police, a 1995 song, which was one of very few compostions done jointly due to a feud between artists and fans of the East Coast hip hop and West Coast hip hop scenes in the United States?", "answer": "Tupac Shakur", "type": "bridge"}, {"question"