erican lawyer who is the incumbent Associate Attorney General?", "answer": "Rachel Brand", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "David Reivers had a starring role in the Disney Channel movie premiering on what date?", "answer": "January 12, 2007", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What band that Mike Peters worked with was formed in Dunfermline, Fife, in 1981?", "answer": "Big Country", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Thomas Mann and Romain Rolland, share which occupations?", "answer": "novelist, essayist", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "12 Monkeys was inspired by the 1962 film that won what short film award?", "answer": "Prix Jean Vigo", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the Irish actor born who was a star of Mister John and who's birth name was Aidan Murphy?", "answer": "24 April 1968", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which region is this tribal group from who fought against the United States Army alongside Palus, Schitsu'umsh (Coeur d'Alene), Spokan, and Yakama warriors at the Battle of Spokane Plains?", "answer": "Northwest Plateau", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What role did this American actress and comedian play in the NBC series \"The Office\" who was also featured in \"Redeeming Rainbow?\"", "answer": "Erin Hannon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is a genus of plants within the daisy family, Auranticarpa or Silphium?", "answer": "Silphium", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Have tennis players Am\u00e9lie Mauresmo and Vitas Gerulaitis both won titles at Wimbledon?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the prenomen or royal name of the ancient ruler of Egypt and a kingdom at the confluences of the Blue Nile, White Nile, and River Atbara?", "answer": "Bakare", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What video collection by Ian Levine was filmed on Central Drive in the seaside town of Blackpool, Lancashire in Northern England and featured American Rhythm and Blues singer Rose Batiste?", "answer": "The Strange World 