n"}, {"question": "Which movie genre did both Alexandre Aja and Roy Andersson direct movies in? ", "answer": "Alexandre Aja (born 7 August 1978) is a French film director best known for his work in various horror films.", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The racetrack that the first race of the 2000 Formula One season was held at, is located around what lake?", "answer": "Albert Park Lake", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "John Sawyer was born in  what small city in Lincoln County, Mississippi that is the county seat of Lincoln County?", "answer": "Brookhaven", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A Film Unfinished and Pride Divide, are which type of film genre?", "answer": "documentary", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which \"Pennsylvania\"-class battleship was sunk in 1941?", "answer": "USS \"Arizona\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Team Brunel finished second in the 2014\u201315 Volvo Ocean Race, skippered by Bouwe Bekking, and will also sail in the 2017\u201318 Volvo Ocean Race, the 13th edition of the round-the-world Volvo Ocean Race, it will start in Alicante, in which country?", "answer": "Spain", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What American actor known for playing Larry Talbot in the 1941 film \"The Wolf Man\" also appeared in the 1933 film Lucky Devils?", "answer": "Lon Chaney Jr.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2010 movie in which the song \"Stop, Drop and Roll\" was featured was a spin-off sequel of what film?", "answer": "\"Forgetting Sarah Marshall\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What company owns the company founded by Kate Cheney Chappell?", "answer": "Colgate-Palmolive", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which is in Hainan province, Lichuan, Hubei or Wenchang?", "answer": "Wenchang", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What 2013 film starred the actor who had a role in a 2014 British drama film directed by Lone Scherfig?", "answer": "\"The White Queen\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "La Fiesta de Santa Barbara features Judy Garland singing a song that translates to what in English?", "answer": "The Cockroach", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Air Jordan Retro XII has a logo that is a silhouette of which person?", "answer": "Michael Jordan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Alex Guerrero (born February 16, 1984) is former American football offensive and defensive lineman, his clients include Arizona Cardinals cornerback Patrick Peterson and which American football safety for the Arizona Cardinals of the National Football League?", "answer": "Tyrann Devine Mathieu", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the name of the 2013 science fiction thriller film starring Academy Award winning actress Octavia Spencer?", "answer": "Snowpiercer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of industry does Danny Buday and Paul Sloane have in common?", "answer": "film", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Publius Valerius Poplicola was the consul of the era of ancient Roman civilization traditionally dated to when?", "answer": "509 BC", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What nationality is the musician who wrote the music of the song Enter Sandman, with Kirk Hammett and James Hetfield ? ", "answer": "Danish", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Chelan Simmons had a role in a 2006 American Supernatural horror film directed by who?", "answer": "James Wong", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Osceola Parkway, signed as County Road 522 (CR 522) since around which year, is a 12.4 mi , partially tolled arterial road extending east\u2013west across the northern boundary of Osceola County, Florida, roughly paralleling the border with Orange County, it connects Walt Disney World with Interstate 4 and Florida's Turnpike, designated as State Road 91 (SR 91) and the Ronald Reagan Turnpike, is a toll road in Florida?", "answer": "2003", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "For what team does the 17th pick of the NHL draft that included Jack Campbell and Brock Nelson play professionally?", "answer": "Lule\u00e5 HF