 famous film helped popularize the music album Tubular Bells created by a musician named after an asteroid?", "answer": "The Exorcist", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who died more recently, Salvatore Naturale, or John Cazale?", "answer": "John Cazale", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What movie special effect is defined by an object is moved in small increments between individually photographed frames, creating the illusion of movement when the series of frames is played and is featured at Special Effects Stage attraction at Universal Studios Hollywood?", "answer": "Stop motion", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Dexter Scott King, born January 30, 1961, is the brother of what oldest living child of civil rights leaders Martin Luther King Jr. and Coretta Scott King?", "answer": "Martin Luther King III", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What companies vessels did the man played by Bernard Hill in Titanic serve as master on", "answer": "White Star Line", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Lapine is a fictional language created for a novel published by who?", "answer": "Rex Collings Ltd of London", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was the founder of the company that manufactures agricultural,construction, forest machinery, diesel engines, drivetrains used in heavy equipment, and lawn care equipment?", "answer": "Hans Walter Becherer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What role did Retta play in Parks and Recreation?", "answer": "Donna Meagle", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Frank Loesser song was covered on Glee: The Music, The Christmas Album?", "answer": "Baby, It's Cold Outside", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Simpsons Already Did It\" is the seventh episode of the sixth season of the American animated television series \"South Park\", and the 86th episode of the series overall, which main character in the Comedy Central series \"South Park\"?", "answer": "Kyle Broflovski", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year did Craig Ball record the soun