ts which performed Geary Lanier Faggett's song was born in December 5, 1931?", "answer": "James Cleveland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many international residetns are there in the city where Jasmine Choi was born?", "answer": "678,102", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of aviation are the Jack Brooks Regional Airport and the Lake Charles Regional Airport used for?", "answer": "general aviation", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are both Those Calloways and Tomorrowland of the same genre?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In which decade were Apricot Computers and the Tiki 100 produced for the educational market?", "answer": "mid-1980s", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Melanie Jayne Chisholm's fourth tour was called what?", "answer": "Beautiful Intentions Tour", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who were the two lead stars of the 1961 film Lover Come Back co-staring the actress who played Alice Nelson in ABC's \"The Brady Bunch\"?", "answer": "Doris Day and Rock Hudson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is taller, Bank of America Tower or 1345 Avenue of the Americas?", "answer": "The Bank of America Tower", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is a ficitional superhero that appeared in DC Comics and had Rama as a potential love interest?", "answer": "Wonder Woman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Steven Gilmore who has created promotional materials for the 2008 film The Dark Night is most known for his artwork in what other form?", "answer": "album cover design", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "John Stephen Goodman, is an American actor, early in his career, he was best known for playing which male primary fictional character in the \"Roseanne\" television series?", "answer": "Dan Conner", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "This British record producer/engineer born in 1947  was involved with the production of Supertramp's Crime of the Century and various songs with David Bowie was born in which year?", "answ