ber of which current President of Russia, holding the office since 7 May 2012?", "answer": "Vladimir Vladimirovich Putin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Kathryn Drysdale played Whom in Vanity Fair", "answer": "Grace Shelley", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Question: What coach, who was born in 1955 took over for Mike Cavan for the Southern Methodist University football team in 2002?", "answer": "Phil Bennett", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which work of vampire literature was adapted into a film in 1994?", "answer": "Interview with the Vampire", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which team that competed in the 2009 Independence Bowl was led by a second-year head coach?", "answer": "Texas A&M Aggies", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is this controversial Canadian-born American whose frank memoirs helped usher in the confessional style of autobiographical writing and whose disciple became a topic of James G. Kiernan's writing?", "answer": "Mary MacLane", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Baselius College, Kottayam, is Malankara Orthodox , and which type of educational institution, whichusually refers to an educational institution that provides workforce education and college transfer academic programs?", "answer": "community college", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " K-1 Grand Prix '93 had a karate bout involving the karateka who participated in what weight class?", "answer": "heavyweight", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Iqaluit Airport hosts which airline that is headquartered in Calgary, Alberta, Canada and whose main base is Edmonton Airport?", "answer": "Canadian North", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The father of the regicide and also nephew of King Al Faisal was the twelfth son to who?", "answer": "King Abdulaziz", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Jane Ann, Lady Winterton's husband was a member of what?", "answer": "Parliament", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Physical Evidence starring Burt Reynolds was the last film directed by which celebra