nded on April 4, 2012?", "answer": "Ghost Hunters International", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Valley of Blood is a science fiction motion picture, now believed to be owned by Turner Classic Movies, an American movie-oriented basic cable and satellite television network owned by the Turner Broadcasting System subsidiary of what company?", "answer": "Time Warner", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What deity is the Mesoamerican counterpart of the Aztec god Q'uq'umatz?", "answer": "Quetzalcoatl", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birth date of the professional boxer who was only one of two people to professionally beat Steven \"Steve\" Luevano?", "answer": "June 30, 1983", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Junket Whore and Diana's Hair Ego, share which characteristics?", "answer": "documentary film", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Is Henry Schein the founder of \"Keurig Green Mountain\"?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which type of accordion was played by Vladislav Zolotaryov?", "answer": "bayan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which actor from Jurassic Park assisted David Henry Hwang direct his 1993 play", "answer": "BD Wong", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which star of \"Benaam\" was also in \"Zanjeer\"?", "answer": "Amitabh Bachchan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which canal is longer, the Shinnecock Canal or the Wiconisco Canal?", "answer": "The Wiconisco Canal", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "This pair of GP2 Series motor races supported a Formula One motor race won by what driver?", "answer": "Nico Rosberg", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "For someone who is currently in office, what honorific prefix is used to address the individual.", "answer": "The Honourable", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How old was the Spanish actress who provides financial support for the Sahara International Film Festival when she made her acting debut? ", "answer": "16", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Viktor Lutze became c