e was the author of The Autobiography of Alice B. Toklas born?", "answer": "Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the 2010 census population of this united city-borough located on Baranof Island, from which the government of what was then the District of Alaska was moved in 1906?", "answer": "8,881", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "first movie exhibited in the Ottoman Empire was translated from French into English as what?", "answer": "The Arrival of a Train at La Ciotat Station", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Joseph Gordon Levitt stared in which movie with Julia Stiles, Heath Ledger, and Larisa Oleunik.", "answer": "10 Things I Hate About You", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year did the star of \"Le Mans\" die?", "answer": "1980", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Natalia Rom was born in the same city as another Opera singer who passed away in which year ?", "answer": "1938", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was this song written, which is a Brazilian bossa nova jazz song and was a duet between Diana Krall and Rosemary Clooney on Brazil?", "answer": "1962", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year is was the director of the movie that Michael Tarn is best known for born?", "answer": "1928", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Navarone Anthony Garibaldi is the son of an American actress and business magnate who played in what long-running television series?", "answer": "Dallas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which rock music fusion genre is adopted by Christian metal band Embodyment on their fourth album?", "answer": "Alternative metal", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Rebound starred the television and stage actress of what nationality?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Norse mythological figure is the basis for the lead female superhero in Fearless Defenders?", "answer": "Brynhildr", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Simon Wincer and Mikael Salomon Australian film directors?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Rye House Stadium formerly held greyhound racing events as a venue near which London commuter belt town?", "answer": "Hoddesdon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which actor from \"All My Children\", also starred in western film The Peacemaker", "answer": "James Mitchell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Coming of Age was cancelled in 2011 along with the comedy-drama that aired on which TV channel?", "answer": "BBC Three", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " I Love Lee Tae-ri starred the actor who left Super Junior in what year?", "answer": "2009", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What film directed by Kathryn Bigelow did Harold Perrineau star in?", "answer": "Zero Dark Thirty", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What two, Three letter companies made a series featuring the guy who killed Jesus.", "answer": "BBC and HBO Films", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the writer and illustrator of the anime and manga series in which Rock Lee is a fictional character?", "answer": "Masashi Kishimoto", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Were V. C. Andrews and John Banville from the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Antonio Mart\u00ednez L\u00f3pez (born 30 June 1997), commonly referred to as Toni Mart\u00ednez, is a Spanish professional footballer who plays as a forward for Premier League club West Ham United, he has represented Spain at under-19 and the Spain national under-17 football team represents Spain in international football at this age level and is controlled by which organization, the governing body for football in Spain?", "answer": "Royal Spanish Football Federation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the intended name of the magazine of Jane Pratt that was shut down in July 2007?", "answer": "Betty", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many people does the city, in which Gerald Asamoah was born, have in the population?", "answer": "42,037", "type": "bridge"