ame of the debut studio album by American rapper from Houston, Texas who was musical partners with rapper Chamillionaire?", "answer": "Chick Magnet", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The author of My Awakening: A Path to Racial Understanding held what title in the Ku Klux Klan?", "answer": "Grand Wizard", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The person that presented \"Was It Something I Said?\" was part of what comedy duo?", "answer": "Mitchell and Webb", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many properties are maintained by the amusement park corporation that first screened the film The Sensorium in 1984?", "answer": "twenty", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What do Gregory Nava and John Rawlins have in common?", "answer": "film director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "When was the American football quarterback born who was supposed to replace by Gabbert  in Week 3?", "answer": "July 12, 1981", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bajillion Dollar Propertie$ is a semi-scripted parody of a Canadian reality television series that airs on W Network in Canada and is produced by who?", "answer": "Cineflix", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "This major metrobus transfer station is located two blocks from a 530000 sqft center was developed in limited partnership with who?", "answer": "the May Centers", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What nationality are both Roy Champan and Lee Chapman?", "answer": "English", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Lynda Thomas and Say Anything both bands?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What year was the ship, in which Sink the Belgrano! was based on, listed as out of service?", "answer": "1982", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of acid was named for the discoverer of the covalent bond?", "answer": "Lewis acid", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the common occupation of Merc\u00e8 Rodoreda and John Wain?", "answer": "novelist", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which American professional baseba