ad it's first three season's background designs lead by Ghostshrimp?", "answer": "Adventure Time", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was the head coach of the 2015 UNLV Rebels Football team born?", "answer": "1974", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What traditional folk song was a single on Here We \u00e0 Go Go Again?", "answer": "Midnight Special", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "For which magazine did the author of the novel \"Burn Witch Burn!\" serve as an editor?", "answer": "American Sunday magazine", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which star of Get Thrashed was in the band Metallica?", "answer": "Lars Ulrich", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Go Soo, also known as Ko Soo, is a South Korean actor, and has appeared in films such as which 2009 South Korean mystery thriller starring Han Suk-kyu, Son Ye-jin and Go Soo?", "answer": "White Night", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born earlier, Velimir Khlebnikov or Bob Dylan?", "answer": "Velimir Khlebnikov", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "La Voix is part of this international television series franchise originally created by who", "answer": "John de Mol", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Between Die schweigsame Frau and La scala di seta, which piece has more acts?", "answer": "Die schweigsame Frau", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are both Derwentia and Elsholtzia endemic to Australia?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is this description of a pattern of group behaviour towards individuals within Nordic countries that Sharmi Albrechtsen explored in her book A Piece of Danish Happiness?", "answer": "Law of Jante", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the sport that Henrik Sedin and Daniel Sedin played together throughout their careers ?", "answer": "Swedish professional ice hockey", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "I Am Your Gummy Bear is the debut album by what German multilingual character?", "answer": "Gummib\u00e4r", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are