ilar to its parent breed which come in what?", "answer": "many colors and patterns", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Express 24/7 was a sister channel to the news channel in what language?", "answer": "Urdu", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On what frequency was the Radio station on which Julian Schiller started presenting the \"Drive\" program?", "answer": "891 kHz", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Murder in Texas was a film starring the actress who won a Golden Globe for what movie?", "answer": "Voyage of the Damned", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Allen & Company Sun Valley Conference previous guest was born on August 15, 1964 ?", "answer": "Melinda Gates", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the mother of Rani Varma born?", "answer": "1926", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Justin Brooks is a defense attorney that represented the NFL player who played for what team in 2013?", "answer": "Atlanta Falcons", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In de mix is a Belgian Flemish television series launched in 2012 and hosted by Moroccan-Belgian R&B singer Brahim Attaeb known as Brahim, it's an adaptation of original series of shows done on Dutch television station TROS and hosted by which fellow Moroccan-Dutch artist?", "answer": "Ali B", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Saint Petersburg Academic University is headed by a physicist born in which year ?", "answer": "1930", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was the Polish composer of Symphony No. 3 born?", "answer": "1933", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"The Sun Always Shines on T.V.\" is a song by Norwegian pop rock music band A-ha, it was released as the third single from their hit debut album,Hunting High and Low, released on which date by Warner Bros?", "answer": "1 June 1985", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What do Cenxi and Ulan Hot have in common?", "answer": "county-level city", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the name of the 2006 film that Jean-Michel Bernard with D