rk on the 2008 American-German action thriller film loosely based on the comic book miniseries of the same name by Mark Millar and J. G. Jones?", "answer": "Common", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which hospital has more beds George Washington University Hospital or Children's National Medical Center ?", "answer": "George Washington University Hospital", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who founded an American family notable for their social prominence, wealth, business enterprises and philanthropy, who has a member by marriage who isan American poet, writer, racehorse owner/breeder, socialite, and philanthropist ?  ", "answer": "John Whitney", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What are occupations of one of the weekly guests of Frankie Boyle's New World Order?", "answer": "writer, stand-up comedian and actress", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the country in the South Caucasus region, situated at the crossroads of Southwest Asia and Southeastern Europe bound by to the east, which is the country of a olk musician and tar-player ?", "answer": "Caspian Sea", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who has the highest scope of profession in Troy Duffy or David Lean ", "answer": "David Lean", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "There's a Great Big Beautiful Tomorrow is the theme song to the prime feature of the GE Pavilion for the 1964 New York World's Fair and what other attraction?", "answer": "Innoventions at Disneyland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Cash collection Accounts receivable is the recovery of cash with which you have issued a commercial document relating to what?", "answer": "a sale transaction", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Although similar, the Istrian Coarse-haired Hound was breed from Croatia, while the Tyrolean Hound: originated from where? ", "answer": "Tyrol", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Ages of Lulu starred which Academy Award-winning Spanish actor?", "answer": "Javier \u00c1ngel Encinas Bardem", "type": "bridge"}, {"q