r You", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On War Against the Turk was a book written during the critical period marked by the first attempt by the Ottoman Empire to capture the city of what?", "answer": "Vienna, Austria", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Raid on Alexandria was a British victory during the War of 1812, but by delaying the British forces may have contributed to the heavy causalities on them in which sea/land battle fought later that year?", "answer": "Battle of Baltimore", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the play released by singer, songwriter and actress Jennette McCurdy, who also appeared on iCarly?", "answer": "Not That Far Away", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Chinese singer recorded the Mandarin version of the song performed by singer Idina Menzel in the American version of Disney's 2013 animated feature film \"Frozen\"?", "answer": "Yao Beina", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Bobby Mackey's musical style can be described by his loyalty in part to an AMerican country music singer-songwriter who was notable for recording what David Allan Coe song?", "answer": "Take This Job and Shove It", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ikea furniture model was from where?", "answer": "Sweden", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What retired Spanish footballer, born 30 March 1982, played for Fiorentina?", "answer": "Javier Portillo", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What country features Chelmsford Cathedral and Cathedral of St John the Evangelist, Portsmouth? ", "answer": "England", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which movie is older, Man from Plains or Chicken Ranch?", "answer": "Chicken Ranch", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "\"Thodi Der\" is a song from the soundtrack of a Bollywood film directed by who?", "answer": "Mohit Suri", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What television network are both Mia Michaels and So You Think You Can Dance on?", "answer": "Fox", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What recreational arcade 