e where he grew up) using anthropomorphic squids?", "answer": "the South", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Without Limits is a biographical sports film about what distance runner who competed in the 1972 Olympics?", "answer": "Steve Roland \"Pre\" Prefontaine", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many miles does the route that the Kenmore Square is the eastern terminus for span?", "answer": "3365", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed the movies\"Only God Forgives\" and \"Bronson\"?", "answer": "Nicolas Winding Refn", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How much stake does Peter Harris own in the British private company which owns Haven Holidays, Butlins, and Warner Leisure Hotels?", "answer": "\u00a3360m", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Angeliki Papoulia starred in The Lobster, with what actor who played newly-single man trying to find someone so he can remain human?", "answer": "Colin Farrell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What actress played in both Jackie Rush and Mean Guns?", "answer": "Deborah Van Valkenburgh", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What role did Malcolm Hebden play in a British soap opera that centers on Coronation Street in Weatherfield?", "answer": "Norris Cole", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What team did Carlos Dunlap play against in the 2009 BCS national championship?", "answer": "Oklahoma Sooners", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of this American animated television series produced by Disney Television Animation whose 18th episode premiered in June, 2013?", "answer": "Gravity Falls", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In a modern film from 2000 reimagining the story of Hamlet, Steve Zahn plays Hamlet's childhood friend Rosencrantz. Where is the drama set?", "answer": "New York City", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Tony Hadley and Seo Eunkwang both radio presenters?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "When does the rock singer born who was marked for his first live performance as a solo