 Beckett, in which Daeg Faerch starred as the messenger?", "answer": "5 January 1953", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What award did the animator of the semi-sequel spin-off to Kung Fu Panda receive?", "answer": "Annie Award", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "SMUD Headquarters Building is the headquarters for the residents of what neighboring county?", "answer": "Placer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What now occupies the old Dunes golf course that is a 1679700 sqft urban complex?", "answer": "CityCenter", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Stan Lee's Mutants, Monsters & Marvels, released in which year, is an American documentary film produced by Creative Light Entertainment, the two talk about Lee's life, his marriage with Joan Boocock Lee, was a British-American hat model and voice actress?", "answer": "2002", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Thomas William Seymour Hunt has written for what bimonthly magazine?", "answer": "The American Interest", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "William \"Bill\" Taylor, was an English footballer who played as a half-back for Southwell, Mansfield Mechanics, Notts County, Shirebrook, Oldham Athletic, Newark Town, and which professional association football club based in Burnley, Lancashire?", "answer": "Burnley F.C.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Shannon Bell is a programme director for what third-largest university in Canada?", "answer": "York University", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What  battle of the Civil War involved the largest number of casualties of the entire war and is often described as the war's turning point, Second Battle of Bull Run or Battle of Gettysburg?", "answer": "Battle of Gettysburg", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which of these musicians has appeared on the show \"American Idol\", Kelly Jones or Chris Daughtry?", "answer": "Chris Daughtry", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "How many performaces did the Opera, that John Stoddart designed the set for \"The Magic Flute\", give in 2004?", 