ve for 5 days in 1746 when on the run from the Duke of Cumberland after the defeat at the Battle of Culloden born?", "answer": "1720", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Rand is a small village and civil parish in the West Lindsey district of Lincolnshire, England and Wragby is a small town and civil parish located where?", "answer": "East Lindsey", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What John Lennon/Yoko Ono Vietnam War protest song was covered by The Incredible Penguins to support research on little penguins?", "answer": "\"Happy Xmas (War Is Over)\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Author and businessman Rolf Dobelli created a non-profit foundation in his native city to connect science, business and cultural figures. In which country?", "answer": "Switzerland", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Philippine Airlines Flight 434, was a flight on which date, from Cebu to Tokyo on a Boeing 747-283B that was seriously damaged by a bomb planted by terrorist Ramzi Yousef, killing one passenger and damaging vital control systems, it was flying the second leg of a route from Ninoy Aquino International Airport, to Narita International Airport?", "answer": "December 11, 1994", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Days of Future Future is a continuation of the Simpsons episode that originally aired on what date?", "answer": "December 11, 2011", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ron Weasley is a fictional character, in which series of fantasy novels, written by the British author, J. K. Rowling?", "answer": "Harry Potter", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Paul Migliazzo was drafted to which NFL team in 1987 under coach Mike Ditka?", "answer": "Chicago Bears", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the Scottish musician and songwriter  which was one of those that left rock band Wings born? ", "answer": "4 June 1953", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Casey Mitchum is portrayed  by the actor who had what role in Grand Theft Auto IV?", "answer": "Brucie Kibbutz", "type": "bridge"}, {"q