inational Christian university is Delano, KS home to?", "answer": "Friends University", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The actor that played Antonio Nappa in \"Oz\" also stars with Kristen Wiig in a Chilean-American drama film directed by who?", "answer": "Sebasti\u00e1n Silva", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which recording artist released its fourth studio album, titled Ether, which featured a guest appearance from singer, songwriter and rapper CeeLo Green?", "answer": "B.o.B.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many comapnies own and operate the railway and metro station in Renens,Vaud, Switzerland?", "answer": "owned by two distinct companies and operated by a third.", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what nation is it the job of Mousa Esmaeilpour to support learns or clients in achieving a specific personal or professional goal specifically in bodybuilding?", "answer": "Iran", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Khandeyar live in what biome that is also known as boreal forest or snow forest?", "answer": "Taiga", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which former pornographic film actress hosted the 1996 Adult Video News awards?", "answer": "Jenna Jameson", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which American television sportscaster born in 1944 is a game commentator in Madden NFL 2005?", "answer": "Al Michaels", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "This politician, born in 1942, was elected to his third Senate term in 1984 for which party? ", "answer": "Democratic", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which university is located in the United States, the University of Nevada, Reno or the University of Miskolc?", "answer": "The University of Nevada, Reno", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is the wife of the artist who was born in the same city as where the National Gallery of Victoria is located and who also has artwork there?", "answer": "Rachel Griffiths", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Dolores O'Riordan and Gerry Marsden both lead singers of a band?", "an