merica on the ship Lord Ligonier passed away in which year ?", "answer": "1822", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What actress and author, made her film debut in the movie Halloween and also starred in 1980 Canadian slasher film Prom Night?", "answer": "Jamie Lee Curtis", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What organization created the Kuznetsov NK-25 engine for the strike bomber used during the Cold War and still remains in service with the Russian Air Force today?", "answer": "Soviet Kuznetsov Design Bureau", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the American musical theatre lyricist who sang  \"Day by Day\" born? ", "answer": "March 6, 1948", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the name of the concentration camp that Jennifer Teege's grandfather, Amon G\u00f6th, was in charge of?", "answer": "Krak\u00f3w-P\u0142asz\u00f3w", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "From which city comes the band that put out the album \"Nothing Is Sound\"?", "answer": "San Diego", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what years did Jo Platt's predecessor hold her office?", "answer": "2001 to 2017", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Emotion is the third studio album by Carly Rae Jepsen, in which she collaborated with a singer who, in 1997, released her debut studio album in Australia, that had what title?", "answer": "OnlySee", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Anne Frank Remembered and The Root of All Evil? are both what?", "answer": "documentary", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who directed the film in which Brian Patrick Stepanek had a supporting role in, which was released on July 22, 2005?", "answer": "Michael Bay", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who played the main antagonist in the New Zealand television film, The Hunchback?", "answer": "Richard Harris", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Barefoot Executive and One Magic Christmas, are which type of entertainment?", "answer": "film", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which of the current presenters on Loose Women w