ett Anderson and Tom Verlaine musicians?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Prominent Imam, Shakeel Begg attempted to secure release of a British taxi driver who became what number of Western hostage killed by the Islamic State? ", "answer": "the fourth", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is younger Cody Hodges or Seth Doege ?", "answer": "Seth Doege", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "where is the American professional basketball was co owned by Clay Bennett based ", "answer": "Oklahoma City,", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Alice's Birthday and Mai Mai Miracle both animated films based on books?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Don't Wanna Fall in Love, is a 1990 hit song for Toronto-born singer/songwriter/musician Jane Child, the single went to number two for three weeks on the \"Billboard\" Hot 100 singles chart, it was kept out of the top spot by which Sin\u00e9ad O'Connor's ballad, a song written and composed by Prince?", "answer": "Nothing Compares 2 U", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Suqian and Shulan cities in China?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What senior United States Army officer, born in September 1860, used United States Army Indian Scouts in 1916 on his expedition to Mexico?", "answer": "John J. Pershing", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Daymond John is an American businessman, investor, television personality, author, and motivational speaker, who is the CEO of American hip hop apparel company that is an acronym for what?", "answer": "For Us, By Us", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who had more political power, Francis Bacon or Thomas Bushell?", "answer": "Francis Bacon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What casino is owner and operated by Caesars Entertainmen5 Corporation and hosted Evo 2013?", "answer": "Paris Las Vegas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What does Bend & Break and Owen Hunt have in common?", "answer": "Grey's Anatomy", "type": "bridge"}, {"ques