ted States, Working Woman or Gloria?", "answer": "Gloria", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What direction does the river that Austrolebias bellotti are found in flow?", "answer": "north to south", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Poljot produced the world's first space watch, that was worn by what Soviet cosmonaut who was the first human to journey to outer space?", "answer": "Yuri Alekseyevich Gagarin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Karen Blixen and E. E. Cummings share?What job did both ", "answer": "author", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Chase is a 2010 Bollywood action film directed by Jagmohan Mundhra, who also directed a 2006 British biographical film that starred Aishwarya Rai, and was based on the true story of who?", "answer": "Kiranjit Ahluwalia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what city are the corporate offices of the company that makes the Wisp mini toothbrush?", "answer": "New York City", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Dutch Golden Age painter had art presented in the Centraal Museum in Netherlands?", "answer": "Gerard van Honthorst", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "James Arness was the real life brother of the actor of which \"Airplaine!\" character?", "answer": "Captain Clarence Oveur", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Geoffrey Whitworth was praised by what Irish playwright who wrote more than sixty plays, including \"Man and Superman\"?", "answer": "George Bernard Shaw", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the 54th Disney animated feature film that won the Oscar for Best Animated Feature in 2015?", "answer": "Big Hero 6", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the director of the 2014 American drama film dealing with online addiction starring the actress who make her breakthrough film debut in the comedy \"Dude, Where's My Car\"?", "answer": "Jason Reitman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was one of the seven original astronauts in Project Mercury and also set an eight-day space endurance record a