r created the superhero which is one of actress Kysten Ritter's best known role ?", "answer": "Brian Michael Bendis", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The son of Glenn Robinson played for what team founded in 1946, originally known as the Syracuse Nationals?", "answer": "Philadelphia 76ers", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Thomas Uva and Rosemarie Uva, were married ex-cons from Ozone Park, Queens and considered a modern-day \"Bonnie and Clyde\", were American criminals who traveled the central United States with their gang during which time period, robbing people and killing when cornered or confronted?", "answer": "Great Depression", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Garden City bus station serves the suburbs of Upper Mount Gravatt and this major shopping center previously operated by who", "answer": "AMP Limited", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In 1997 Bob Perkins joined WRTI-FM at a university founded by what Baptist Minister?", "answer": "Russell Conwell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the person titled Drift King who helped with editorial supervision of the sports manga series, Initial D?", "answer": "Keiichi Tsuchiya", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Tank Man was the name of the unidentified man standing in front of the Chinese military in what city?", "answer": "Beijing", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the boxer who eventually defeated Bakhodir Jalolov born?", "answer": "1985", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "While Rhaphidophora is a genus in the family Araceae, what genus is Cyathodes?", "answer": "genus of shrubs within the heath family", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was born first, Fher Olvera or Geoff Rickly?", "answer": "Jos\u00e9 Fernando Emilio \"Fher\" Olvera Sierra", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which of the stars on Le Jaguar is also a professional poker player?", "answer": "Patrick Bruel", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Alejandro \"Alec\" Mapa, is an American actor, comedian and wr