outh Australian Football League", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Damon Albarn is an English singer, songwriter, and multi-instrumentalist, and principal songwriter of Gorillaz virtual band, an English virtual band created in which year, by musician Damon Albarn and artist Jamie Hewlett?", "answer": "1998", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Chengdu J-20 is what type of aircraft that is designed to avoid detection, and whose technology likely began in Germany during World War II?", "answer": "Stealth aircraft", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which role-playing board game was originally released first: Space Hulk or Torres?", "answer": "Space Hulk", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "When were the band that had the song \"Show You the Way to Go\" formed?", "answer": "1964", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Singapore Airlines Cargo (abbreviated as SIA Cargo) is a cargo airline based in Singapore, it operates seven dedicated freighter aircraft and also manages the bellyhold of NokScoot Airlines Company Limited, trading as NokScoot, is a low-cost medium- to long-haul airline, based in which country?", "answer": "Thailand-based", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the nationality of \"The Jungle Book\" author?", "answer": "English", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which tropical cyclone was the final cyclone to affect the Phillippines during the 1984 Pacific typhoon season?", "answer": "Typhoon Agnes", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Femme Fatales included which actor known for a role in Mad About You and Spin City?", "answer": "Richard Bruce Kind", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What team did the owner of the Columbus based steel processing company that sold 3.38 billion in 2015 own?", "answer": "Columbus Blue Jackets NHL team", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Sonnet 20 and Sonnet 1, were written by which English playwright and poet?", "answer": "William Shakespeare", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which member of the 2011 New Orleans Saints season 