dge"}, {"question": "on which Norwegian band does  Hustoft worked with Morten Harket", "answer": "A-ha", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 1979\u201380 Phoenix Suns season was the 12th season for the Phoenix Suns of the National Basketball Association, the Suns were led by head coach John MacLeod, an American, his which number season with the team?", "answer": "seventh", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The wife of which king gave birth to a daughter who supposedly had an illegitimate child as a young girl?", "answer": "King George III", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Goldfield Hills is a mountain range in Esmeralda County, Nevada, south of the mining district and town of Goldfield, Goldfield is an unincorporated community and the county seat of Esmeralda County, Nevada, in which country?", "answer": "United States", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Mike Pittilo was Pro Vice-Chancellor of a university whose antecedent institution was Hatfield Technical College, which was founded when?", "answer": "1948", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the sergeant that was traded in exchange for the Taliban Five born?", "answer": "1986", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which documentary was released first, The Seine Meets Paris or Shape of the Moon?", "answer": "The Seine Meets Paris", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Joanna Wi\u015bniewska (born 24 May 1972 in Wroc\u0142aw) is a discus thrower from Poland, her personal best throw is 63.97 metres, achieved at which event, that took place in Palma de Mallorca, Spain, in 1999?", "answer": "1999 Summer Universiade", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Could I Leave You?\" was a song in Follies, a musical concering what?", "answer": "a crumbling Broadway theatre", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who wrote, directed and starred in both Madea Boo! movies?", "answer": "Tyler Perry", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Pinsky phenomenon is a result in a branch of mathematics named after who?", "answer": "Jo