racter played by Michael Fassbender in a film about the 1981 Irish hunger strike directed by Steve McQueen?", "answer": "Bobby Sands", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The school where Caroline B. Mason was the Head of School starting in 2003 was established in what year?", "answer": "1813", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do the bands My Sister's Machine and Grinderman have the same number of members?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who has had a solo singing career, Ryan McCombs or Toshimitsu Deyama?", "answer": "Toshimitsu Deyama", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What African American who was beaten by Los Angeles Police Department in March 1991 was referenced in the song \"Mrs. Offider\" by Lil Wayne?", "answer": "Rodney King", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2016 Superbike World Championship was the 29th season of the Superbike World Championship, Jonathan Rea won his second consecutive Superbike World Championship title at the first race, Rea a British professional motorcycle racer, was born on which date?", "answer": "2 February 1987", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Drew Gordon is the older brother of a player for the Orlando MAgic who played one year of college basketball at what university?", "answer": "University of Arizona", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Between Chad Kroeger and Benjamin Burnley, who has written more for films?", "answer": "Chad Robert Turton", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are both Skye Sweetnam and Spin Doctors considered American musicians?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What artist might have influenced the song, \"The Devil's Bleeding Crown\"?", "answer": "Elvis Presley and Johnny Cash", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Columbia, Missouri university did Streetballer actor Jimmy McKinney attend?", "answer": "The University of Missouri", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "which cousin is older?", "answer": "Mohamed Sissoko", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which