sys", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What College is located down Route 103 from Guild, New Hampshire?", "answer": "Northeast Catholic College", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Tennessee county contains the city where the 1999 Liberty Bowl was held?", "answer": "Shelby County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "This former footballer was part of the ye-ye's and nicknamed \"El Brujo\".", "answer": "Amancio Amaro", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who wrote the American comedy film owned by Chad Willett?", "answer": "Derek Connolly", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who likely release a song first, Chevelle or Miles Kane?", "answer": "Chevelle", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the name of the Penn State Lady Lions Basketball team who was a correspondent for ESPN and also covered the O.J. Simpson mrder case for ABC?", "answer": "Lisa Salters", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "3 Days in Havana was directed by an actor best known for what role in \"The Shawshank Redemption\"?", "answer": "Tommy Williams", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "John Charles Dykstra, is an American special effects artist, pioneer in the development of the use of computers in filmmaking and recipient of three Academy Awards, he also led special effects on many other movies, including which 1997 American superhero film based on the DC Comics characters Batman and Robin?", "answer": "Batman & Robin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In which country was the 2016 Pakistan Super League cricket Final played?", "answer": "United Arab Emirates", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the midfielder of the professional football club in the Kersal area of Salford?", "answer": "Steven Roy Hogg", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Molson Coors Brewing Company and FLIR Systems, are base in which country?", "answer": "United States", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What type of media does Robert J. Schwalb and A Song of Ice and Fire Roleplaying have in common?", "answer": "role-pla