n Irish Wolfhound or a Siberian Husky?", "answer": "Irish Wolfhound", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Where is the coast located that the Osmodes omar inhabits?", "answer": "West Africa", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On what continent can both Eucryphia and Phaius be found?", "answer": "Australia", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was the grandfather of the man confined to the American coastal pentagonal bastion fort known for its role in the War of 1812?", "answer": "Francis Scott Key", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On what date was the album that featured the song \"Untitled 03 | 05.28.2013.\" released?", "answer": "March 4, 2016", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Confession is a 10-part web series starring an actor who David Lynch described as what?", "answer": "simply the greatest actor in the world", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Birds of Satan and Vector, share which genre?", "answer": "rock", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In what year did the television series on which Michelle Mitchenor portrays Detective Sonya Bailey premier?", "answer": "2016", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who hosts \"The Colbert Report\" and wrote I Am America?", "answer": "Stephen Colbert", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How many Oscar nominations did the narrator of \"The Legend of Marilyn Monroe\" receive?", "answer": "15", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2015 Baylor Bears football team represented a university founded in what year?", "answer": "1845", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "American Hairless Terrier and Old Danish Pointer, are breeds of which animal?", "answer": "dog", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "SMS is a song by the singer and actress who became a teen idol during what television series?", "answer": "Hannah Montana", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Old German Shepherd Dog and Briquet Griffon Vend\u00e9en, are which breed of animal?", "answer": "dog", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "No Deposit, No Return and Sno