d? ", "answer": "Susan Kyle", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type creative work do Yodel It! and Shake It Off have in common?", "answer": "song", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Woman Obsessed stars which Jewish actor and folk singer?", "answer": "Theodore Meir Bikel", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Belushi: A Biography is an \"oral history\" biography of a comedian born in what year?", "answer": "1949", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "WHere is the person who stars in Visions of the Future a professor?", "answer": "City College of New York", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who funded the award for Research on Fundamental Issues, who's selection committees have included a French physicist noted for his experimental work on quantum entanglement.?", "answer": "University of Toronto", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Besides actor , what profession do Jack Black and Fish (Derek William Dick ) have in common?", "answer": "singer", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Christian ensemble drama starring, amongst others, \"The Boz\", was released on March 20 of which year?", "answer": "2015", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the population of the town near which the 2016 Ghana bus collision occured?", "answer": "49,046", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What area is known as the \"Isle of 8 Flags\" and is home to the Fernandina Beach Historic District?", "answer": "Amelia Island", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Air Marshal Denzil Keelor PVSM, AVSM, VrC, KC  is a retired air marshal from what arm of the Indian armed forces?", "answer": "Indian Air Force", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where is the company founded by Michael Chance's grandfather main office located?", "answer": "Wichita, Kansas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Elizabeth Smylie and Tom\u00e1s Carbonell, share which mutual occupation?", "answer": "professional tennis player", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In what year was the \"Diary of a Wimpy Kid\" actress who starred wit