r Swift, was written by Swift, and produced by who?", "answer": "Nathan Chapman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Fuding and Wuwei, Gansu both Asian Cities?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who wrote an investment guide published by Orion in 1992 who named his approach to investment when he observed that after reading a short article on the Zulu people in the an American general-interest family magazine, published ten times a year his wife was better informed on the subject than he himself was ?", "answer": "Jim Slater", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Magazine Special (\u30de\u30ac\u30b8\u30f3SPECIAL ) is a Japanese sh\u014dnen manga magazine published by Kodansha , many of the popular series in \"Magazine Special\" were transferred there from other Kodansha publications like which weekly \"sh\u014dnen\" manga anthology published in Japan by Kodansha, first published on March 17, 1959?", "answer": "Weekly Sh\u014dnen Magazine", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Can Lysichiton and Lewisia both be found in America?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who were two of Malin Maria Akerman's costars in the comedy film \"27 Dresses\"?", "answer": "Katherine Heigl and James Marsden", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What city contains the headquarters of the main competitor for the Atom chip based in California?", "answer": "San Diego", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Edgar Rice Burroughs and Graham Swift, have which occupation in common?", "answer": "writer", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which genus has more species Colletia or Discaria?", "answer": "Colletia", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Is Gavin Rossdale or Jake Burns an actor?", "answer": "Gavin McGregor Rossdale", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which M.I.A. album, featuring the song Jimmy, features musical influences including dance music and South Asian music?", "answer": "Kala", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which magazine was founded earlier