, "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "After the formation associated to a period of crustal thining what amount of time did a long-lasting mountain building event occur?", "answer": "50 million years", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What part of New York City are Socrates Sculpture Park and The Noguchi Museum located?", "answer": "Queens", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the school located near the Brea mall owned by Simon Property Group?", "answer": "Brea Olinda High School", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birth date of this Spanish footballer, who was added as a holding midfielder in the 2012-13 FC Bayern Munich season?", "answer": "2 September 1988", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Wyatt A. Stewart funraised to restore an island located where?", "answer": "Upper New York Bay", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Which band has received the most Grammy Award nominations, Slint, or Sixpence None the Richer?", "answer": "Sixpence None the Richer", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What French noble family is originally from a northeastern French town, whose name is \"Wirten\" in medieval German, has surviving family members in Scandinavia, Spain, and Germany?", "answer": "Tabouillot", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "On what sport are Anna-Lena Gr\u00f6nefeld and Rick Leach professionals?", "answer": "tennis", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the name of this city in Oregon to which KUIK is licensed?", "answer": "Hillsboro", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Ward Melville High School is a public high school in which school district which Ward Melville, a local philanthropist, contributed land for?", "answer": "Three Village Central School District", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the major difference between the Swedish Lapphund and the Tweed Water Spaniel?", "answer": "The Tweed Water Spaniel, or Tweed Spaniel, is a breed of dog extinct", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Lolo Peak Fire took place