rn in what year?", "answer": "1990", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which rock band has most recently been on tour, The Juliana Theory or Urge Overkill?", "answer": "The Juliana Theory", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the name of the multi-sport event that was cancelled in 2011?", "answer": "Asian Indoor Games", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When did the Army arsenal formerly located on the site now occupied by the Midewin National Tallgrass Prairie open?", "answer": "1940", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Disney film was made first, Treasure Island or Race to Witch Mountain?", "answer": "Treasure Island", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "which Northern Irish professional footballer  was part of Manchester United United Trinity or the Holy Trinity", "answer": "George Best", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do Joe Gittleman and Johnny Borrell  have the same nationality ?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "In 1996, Terence P. Jeffrey became editor of a website founded as a newspaper in what year?", "answer": "1944", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the sister of Audrey Kathryn Lindvall born who is a supermodel?", "answer": "January 14, 1979", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Adolf Bastion influenced the thought of a man who wrote what? ", "answer": "The Hero with a Thousand Faces", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which documentary came out first, The Real Dirt on Farmer John or Prophet's Prey?", "answer": "The Real Dirt on Farmer John", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is the controller of the basketball team in which M\u00e1ximo Fjellerup played for in addition to Bah\u00eda Basket?", "answer": "Argentine Basketball Federation", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both Variety and The Advocate LGBT-interest magazines?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the nationality above?", "answer": "British", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The former sheriff of Maricopa County, who