ional character from the American horror drama television series \"The Walking Dead\", younger, half-sister of Maggie, the character has no counterpart in the comic book series on which the show is based, The Walking Dead is an ongoing black-and-white comic book series created by writer Robert Kirkman and which artist?", "answer": "Tony Moore", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are Mr Lordi and Jeff Martin from the same country?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The Great Seal\" is the national anthem of the NSK State, the lyrics taken from a speech delivered on which day ?", "answer": "4 June 1940", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which cocktail uses egg white as an ingredient, The Clover Club Cocktail or The U-Boot?", "answer": "The Clover Club Cocktail", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which Linkin Park studio album featured the songs \"Halfway Right\" and \"Heavy\"?", "answer": "One More Light", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of this major American airline fron 1924 until 2001 that was owned by the originally named Trans World Corporation?", "answer": "Trans World Airlines", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed the musical film adaptation from which Scrooge was closely adapted? ", "answer": "Ronald Neame", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which has more species: Saxegothaea or Fragaria?", "answer": "Fragaria", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who worked for a democratic presidential nomination in 1988?", "answer": "Joseph Patrick \"Joe\" Lockhart", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Anthony Robinson was a friend of a prominent British Whig statesman whose parliamentary career spanned how many years?", "answer": "38", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The belief that African peoples share a common destiny opposes the regime of what Prime Minister?", "answer": "Leabua Jonathan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A unitary sovereign state in what part of the world was linked to illegal export of electronic waste