er": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which artist worked alongside the South African record producer to assist with production?", "answer": "Wizkid", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Abdoulaye Seye won a gold medal for 100m in 1959 in what city?", "answer": "Beirut", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A Bay Breeze and A Monkey Gland are both what type of Alcoholic Beverage?", "answer": "Cocktail", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Do Garo Yepremian and Howard Kazanjian both share the same profession ?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The chairman of the United States House Select Committee on Benghazi is a member of the Republican party and what movement?", "answer": "Tea Party movement", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Donald B. Prell is a venture capitalist, author and futurist who created \"Datamation\", owned by QuinStreet and is published as an online magazine at what website?", "answer": "Datamation.com", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the Italian professional footballer who is  Lazio targets born", "answer": "28 January 1978", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which magazine maintains the ranking of fighters in the weight class which Joanna J\u0119drzejczyk competes within?", "answer": "The Ring", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which song in  Rated R stdio album and has Slash played the guitar was released on May 18, 2010?", "answer": "Rockstar 101", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Kurt Budke was the head coach for the team that competes in what Division I conference?", "answer": "Big 12", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was an alternative rock band from Chicago, Illinois that was active from 1985 to 1998, Veridia or Catherine ?", "answer": "Catherine", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Satellite High school was founded in what year and what is on the end of a scorpions tail", "answer": "1962", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was the owner of Sovereign press who is also the creator of \"Drag