enge Brothers actor also played Noah Levenstein in all eight of the \"American Pie\" films?", "answer": "Eugene Levy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the sister company of the airline which serves Sauce Viejo Airport?", "answer": "Aerol\u00edneas Argentinas", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Canadan professional wrestler was part of the tag team known as reDRagon with  Bobby Fish ?", "answer": "Kyle Greenwood", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what european counrty is the Miniat\u00fcrk and Church of SS Peter and Paul, Istanbul located? ", "answer": "Turkey", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which movie was released by Disneynature, Air Bud or Monkey Kingdom?", "answer": "Monkey Kingdom", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Were Le\u00f3n Klimovsky and J.A. Steel both directors in their lives?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Hedi Slimane was the creative director for what French luxury fashion house from 2012 to 2016?", "answer": "Yves Saint Laurent", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The 2011\u201312 Denver Pioneers represent which co-ed university?", "answer": "University of Denver", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who currently represents the congressional district for which George Demos was a candidate for the Republican nomination?", "answer": "Lee Zeldin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the capital of the island with a creature called the small Spanish lobster?", "answer": "Hamilton", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which English novelist authored books published by a children's book editor based in Oxford?", "answer": "Philip Pullman CBE, FRSL (born 19 October 1946)", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The brother of  Zlatko Ivankovi\u0107 currently manages what Pro League team?", "answer": "Persepolis", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What nationality was the superhero animated television series in which Tara Strong had a voice role?", "answer": "American", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the