Caribbean affected by which natural disaster?", "answer": "Hurricane Irma", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which primary foreign intelligence agency of India is Rabinder Singh was a joint secretary in", "answer": "The Research and Analysis Wing", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "China Airlines established what low-cost carrier that is based at Taoyuan International Airport?", "answer": "Tigerair Taiwan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "James R. Handy served in which upper house of the Maine legislature from 1992-94?", "answer": "Maine Senate", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was Fallout 3 created?", "answer": "2001", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed a Chinese film starring an American actor that won an Academy Award for American Beauty?", "answer": "Dayyan Eng", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What US city was named after a coastal town in England and is where the retired professional ice hockey player Kurt Adrian Walker was born?", "answer": "Weymouth, Massachusetts", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Electoral district of Broadmeadows is an electorate of the Victorian Legislative Assembly, it includes the suburb of Broadmeadows,  a suburb of Melbourne, Victoria, in which country?", "answer": "Australia", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What country does Jiangyan District and Dalian have in common?", "answer": "China", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who starred as sugar in a movie with the actor who plays Roy Trenneman on The IT Crowd?", "answer": "Romola Garai", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which game can include more players, Zombies!!! or Carcassonne?", "answer": "Zombies!!!", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Lech Kolakowski was a candidate elected to the Sejm from a party who holds how many seats in the Sejm?", "answer": "216", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What city, located South of Raymond, Montana, is the county seat of Sheridan County, Montana?", "answer": "Plentywood", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Le