 Price bron in?", "answer": "Bergen County, New Jersey", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Renault\u2013Nissan\u2013Mitsubishi Alliance is a Franco-Japanese strategic partnership between automobile manufacturers Renault, it controls which automobile brand owned by Nissan?", "answer": "Datsun", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Snow Tha Product, who released Good Nights and Bad Mornings 2, is from which state?", "answer": "California", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What ill fated baseball promotion is the most notable part of the Detroit Tigers 1979 baseball season?", "answer": "Disco Demolition Night", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which group carried out the pub bombings that men such as Gerard \"Gerry\" Conlon were convicted of?", "answer": "Provisional Irish Republican Army", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Stolen Honor and V-Day: Until the Violence Stops were both what type of film?", "answer": "documentary", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What Italian born film actor starred in the 2015 movie Burnt?", "answer": "Riccardo Scamarcio", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which lottery included in the Iowa Lottery portfolio is available in 14 states?", "answer": "Hot Lotto", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year was the composer of \"Troubled Island\" born?", "answer": "1895", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The city that hosted the Virginia Renaissance Faire between 1996 and 1999 had a population of 24,286 in what census?", "answer": "the 2010 census", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What writer-artist created the character who is trying to amass Infinity Stones in Avengers: Infinity War?", "answer": "Jim Starlin", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are both both Matthew Good Band and David Cook American?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Lino Schmidek Machado Facioli played Naples in which 2010 American black comedy film written, produced and directed by Nicholas Stoller and starring Russell Brand and Jonah Hill?", "answer