ove You (Miss Robot)\" and has music that includes musical elements and influences of disco, punk, progressive rock and 1960s pop music?", "answer": "the Buggles", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A song that was performed in Danish was performed by what type of music group at the Eurovision Song Contest in 1982?", "answer": "pop", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is older, Ignacio Torres or Cuauhtemoc Blanco?", "answer": "Cuauht\u00e9moc Blanco", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What 1945 American comedy film, directed by Hal Walker, did Eddie Bracken, the comedy legend that appeared in \"Hail the Conquering Hero\" and \"The Miracle of Morgan's Creek\" appear?", "answer": "Duffy's Tavern", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The west Gate Lodge is connected to Cardiff Castle by the Animal Wall depicting what?", "answer": "15 animals", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Weapons of the Gods, is a Hong Kong comic book series by Wong Yuk Long, which began in 1996, a version, a wuxia role-playing game based in an ancient Chinese setting, was published by Eos Press, in what year?", "answer": "2005", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What type of films were the film Amy, directed by Asif Kapadia, and the film A Life in the Death of Joe Meek by Howard S. Berger and Susan Stahman?", "answer": "documentary", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "According to the 2012 census, what is the population of the city where Michael Medor was born?", "answer": "149,194", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Jump is a British television series that follows celebrities as they try to master various winter sports, which is Britain's first Olympic ski jumper, who in 1988 became the first competitor since 1929 to represent Great Britain in Olympic ski jumping, finishing last in the 70 m and 90 m events?", "answer": "Eddie \"The Eagle\" Edwards", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the release date of the Green Day album that House Industries worked on?", "answer": "February 1, 1994", "t