en a magazine editor and has a video blog called JaHeRo on her website?", "answer": "Rosie O'Donnell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"I Know There's Gonna Be (Good Times)\" is a song by English music producer Jamie xx, th song was released from debut studio album, \"In Colour\", on which date in the UK?", "answer": "22 May 2015", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Between Andrei Olhovskiy and Jelena Jankovi\u0107, who became a pro earlier?", "answer": "Andrei Stanislavovich Olhovskiy", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "who is younger Kay Pollak or Kim Ki-duk ?", "answer": "Kim Ki-duk", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The artist who wrote and sang Ab Khel Jamay Ga was born on what month?", "answer": "May", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which magazine is still in circulation, Look or Woman's Home Companion?", "answer": "Look", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which team is the former head coach of the Lamar Cardinals basketball team during the 2013\u201314 season currently working for?", "answer": "Indiana Pacers", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Cronulla railway line is owned by a corporation with a portfolio of how many billions of railway property?", "answer": "$28.6", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the third studio album titled by a band that was formed in Glasgow in 1990?", "answer": "The Invisible Band", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Brain Box was a live, interactive quiz show, showing in Northern Ireland and the Republic of Ireland on which commercial television broadcaster in Northern Ireland owned and operated by ITV plc as part of the ITV Network?", "answer": "UTV", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "John Gatins was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Original Screenplay for a movie directed by who ?", "answer": "Robert Zemeckis", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The song \"Seether\" appeared in a film starring what actress?", "answer": "Charlize Theron", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What Little Village member was 