ver for Springfield Elementary, voiced by whom?", "answer": "Harry Shearer", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What certification from the Recording Industry Association of Japan was received in 1999 by the American girl group which released \"Girl Talk\" in 2002?", "answer": "Million", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which airport Airport serves most of East Hawai, Logan International Airport and Hilo International Airport?", "answer": "Hilo International Airport", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Junta and Ashta Chamma are both what?", "answer": "board game", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": " \"It Never Rains (In Sourthern California)\" was directed by Lisa Bonet, what sitcom did she play Denise Huxtable?", "answer": "\"The Cosby Show\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "MacGruber stars Will Forte in the title role, along with his love interest, American actress, comedian, writer and producer, born on what day?", "answer": "born August 22, 1973", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the music composer for Andrew Lau and Alan Mak's 2002 crime thriller film born?", "answer": "June 15, 1967", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Meridian Bank is a soon-to-be federally chartered bank in Canada, owned and operated by Meridian Credit Union Ltd., Meridian Bank is a soon-to-be federally chartered bank in Canada, owned and operated by Meridian Credit Union Ltd., a Canadian credit union, was formed on which date?", "answer": "April 1, 2005", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "How long is the tributary of the East River that the Grand Street Bridge crosses?", "answer": "3.5 mi", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born first, Thomaz Koch or Peter Fleming?", "answer": "Thomaz Koch", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which band is from American, A-ha or The Mountain Goats?", "answer": "The Mountain Goats", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which singer was a member of a blues band, John McCrea or George Thorogood?", "answer": "George Thorogood", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which actor, best known for his role in the film Hard Boiled, was in a movie directed by Andrew Lau and Alan Mak?", "answer": "Anthony Wong", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The writer of the Simpson's episode \"How the Test Was Won\" is a co-executive producer of what ABC series?", "answer": "\"Teacher's Pet\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Do directors Sean S. Cunningham and Scott Sidney have the same nationality?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who operates the location that Not Now, Comrade was shot at?", "answer": "Elstree Film Studios Limited", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Quality Street, a 1937 period film made by RKO Radio Pictures, was based on the 1901 play of the same name by what Scottish novelist and playwright, best remembered today as the creator of Peter Pan?", "answer": "J. M. Barrie", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What's the present day English county of Skelton-in-Cleveland, recorded in the Domesday Book and site of a 12th-century castle?", "answer": "North Yorkshire", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born first, Micha\u00ebl Llodra or Henri Leconte?", "answer": "Henri Leconte", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What former Australian rules footballer finished runner up in the 2005 AFL season?", "answer": "Daniel Kerr", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Scheherazade\", composed by Nikolai Rimsky-Korasakov is known as this type of music?", "answer": "symphonic suite", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "\"Amuse-Bouche\" is the second episode of the first season of the psychological thriller\u2013horror series \"Hannibal\", it has focus on the relationship between FBI special investigator and Dr. Hannibal Lecter played by Mads Mikkelsen, a character in a series of suspense novels by who?", "answer": "Thomas Harris", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What nationality are both John Quigley and Tiffanie DeBartolo?", "answer": "American", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What was th