r the pagan period, is the mythology derived from  that is also the mythology featured in Mats Wendt's 16 hour-long cybersyomphic work \"Eddan - the invincible sword of the elf-smith\"?", "answer": "medieval manuscripts, archaeological representations, and folk tradition", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which magazine was founded earlier, the Texas Monthly or the Humbug? ", "answer": "Humbug", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is best known for directing the \"Doctor\" series of films, Ralph Thomas or Rian Johnson?", "answer": "Ralph Philip Thomas MC", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which of the writers of the song \"Bop Bop Baby\" was born 5 July 1979?", "answer": "Shane Filan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "WHen was the place where KZGO's transmitters are located completed?", "answer": "1972", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Rogers Fort Hill Park Historic District is in a city that in 2014 had an estimated population of what?", "answer": "109,945", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Under what other name did the erotic dancer who made the bubble dance famous perform?  ", "answer": "Billie Beck", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Other the Celts, name other ways people from Poland are identified.", "answer": "Germanic, Baltic and Thracian tribes", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which writer was also a translator, Harold Pinter or Fernando Pessoa?", "answer": "Fernando Pessoa", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the name of the American actor, director, producer, and singer songwriter who features on the album Disneymania 5 with 3 other stars from 'High School Musical?", "answer": "Lucas Grabeel", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": " Ole Yde is a Danish fashion designer based in a city that as of 2016 has a population of what?", "answer": "763,908", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which store in London was an early version of the type of store that Dealz is classified as?", "answer": "Whiteleys", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Dia