t of Germany from 1925 until 1934 a design influence on?", "answer": "Three Sisters bridges", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The American singer-songwriter Taylor Swift released which album co-written by Max Martin and Shellback and inspired by the singer's \"semi-toxic\" relationships she experienced?", "answer": "Red", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The best scorer for Romania at the FIFA World Cup is a former football striker born in what year?", "answer": "1970", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who directed a movie that shared and actress with the breakup guru and was released in 2015?", "answer": "Ahn Sang-hoon", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which author wrote \"The Day of the Jackal\", Frederick Forsyth or Jack London?", "answer": "Frederick McCarthy Forsyth", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who is known more for their work as a director, Lawrence Kasdan or Lois Weber?", "answer": "Lois Weber", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": " The Band-e-Amir Dragons, a first-class cricket team, share their name with the first national park in what nation?", "answer": "Afghanistan", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was the real name of the jester of the last French monarch of the House of Valois?", "answer": "Jean-Antoine d'Anglerais", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The daughter of playwright Robert Courtneidge starred with Jack Hulbert in what 1940 musical comedy film?", "answer": "Under Your Hat", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which pizza shop was created by a company merger, Papa Murphy's or Hungry Howie's Pizza?", "answer": "It began in 1995 as the merger of two take-and-bake pizza companies: Papa Aldo's Pizza (founded in 1981) and Murphy's Pizza (founded in 1981).", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Are Thalia and Helichrysum both types of plants?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Puffin Rock is an Irish children's television series that originally aired on RT\u00c9jr in Ireland, and in the UK on Nick Jr. Too, (formerl