ame country?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Jason Hooten is the head coach of the Men's Basketball team at a public institution of higher learning founded in what year?", "answer": "1879", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "La monta\u00f1a sagrada was directed, written, produced, co-scored, co-edited by and starring the same man who wrote, scored, directed and starred in a film about a violent, black-clad gunfighter and his quest for what?", "answer": "enlightenment", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the singer who had the album Pensando En Ti born?", "answer": "26 April 1951", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In between German Pinscher and Berger Blanc Suisse who got the full acceptance to AKC in 2003?", "answer": "German Pinscher", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who wrote and directed the film \"It Follows,\" starring Olivia Luccardi? ", "answer": "David Robert Mitchell", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A Woman's Revenge is a 1921 German silent drama film directed by Robert Wiene and starring Vera Karalli,, who was an actress and what kind of dancer during the early years of the 20th century?", "answer": "ballet", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the catastrophic EF5-rated multiple-vortex tornado struck after which the Missouri Militia members have been active in disaster relief?", "answer": "May 22, 2011", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was Jason Gilardi's mother born?", "answer": "1942", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What describes a stylistic fusion of metalcore with elements of various electronic music genres, such as trance, electronica, dubstep, or others whos genre has a band from Yaroslavl , that is a portmanteau of what?", "answer": "\"electronic\" and \"metalcore\"", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Haringey Heartlands is located west of a large shopping centre and residential complex that is still referred to by what former name?", "answer": "Wood Green Shopping City", "type": "bridge"}, {"q