hy", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who is the 2013 Gramophone Awards Artist of the Year who has been featured at Royston Arts Festival in recent years?", "answer": "Alison Balsom", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who was born first, Charles Mantagu Doughty or Rory Stewart?", "answer": "Charles Montagu Doughty", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which actress is known for her role as Petunia Dursley in the \"Harry Potter\" films and stars in the limited anthology series whose first season is directed by Craig William Macneill?", "answer": "Fiona Shaw", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "A Life Too Short was a biography about the goalkeeper of what nationality?", "answer": "German", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Letterkenny Munitions Center, located on Letterkenny Army Depot in Franklin County, Pennsylvania, is a satellite activity under Crane Army Ammunition Activity in Crane, Indiana, Letterkenny Army Depot (originally Letterkenny Ordnance Depot), the Center of Industrial and Technical Excellence (CITE) for Air Defense and Tactical Missile Systems, was established in which year?", "answer": "1942", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Dolos is a spirit who was the son of which primordial deity?", "answer": "Aether", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What was  built in 2000 by Swiss manufacturers Bolliger & Mabillard at Janfusun Fancyworld in Taiwan and was the second dive coaster model to be built next to a theme park resort located in Staffordshire, England, near the village of Alton wher the first is loctated at?", "answer": "Diving Machine G5", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the year of birth of the author of Colliget?", "answer": "1126", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What 2015 romantic fantasy film directed by Kenneth Branagh had a screen play written by Chris Weitz?", "answer": "Cinderella", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "At what venue does the team Kyle Kendrick played for before the Boston Red Sox hold its home games?", "answer": "Coors Field", 