d in Middlesbrough, North Yorkshire?", "answer": "Middlesbrough Football Club", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which school is ranked first for  business administration, mining engineering and life sciences in Australia? University of Iowa or University of Queensland? ", "answer": "The University of Queensland", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What song from Gwen Stefani's album The Sweet Escape is an apology for a fight between two lovers?", "answer": "The Sweet Escape", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which magazine was published first, Genre or Architectural Digest?", "answer": "Architectural Digest", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "The actor in television show The Amazing Spider Man is known for his role as Friedrich Von Trapp in which film", "answer": "The Sound of Music", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Was La forza del destino or La boh\u00e8me composed by Giacomo Puccini?", "answer": "La boh\u00e8me", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Do both Art Laboe and Sako Shahinian practice the same profession ?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who was the father of the emporer who established the Meissen Cathedral?", "answer": "Henry I the Fowler", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "MTV1987 was written by the rapper from what Texas city?", "answer": "Corpus Christi", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When did the genre that Magtens Korridorer is in get its start?", "answer": "1970s", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Where did Emmanuelle Seigner's 1999 film premier?", "answer": "San Sebasti\u00e1n, Spain", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What year was the university with the building named after John William Calhoun founded?", "answer": "1881", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Inter IIT Sports Meet is the annual sports tournament of what autonomous public insititutes of higher education in India?", "answer": "The Indian Institutes of Technology", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "GMC Denali is considered a less expensive alternative 