th Mahesh Bhupathi and Jamie Murray won Grand Slam tournaments?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Who founded the Sundance Film Festival and also appeared in the 2001 film Spy Game?", "answer": "Robert Redford", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In between Steven Soderbergh and R\u00e9mi Lange who's film is \"Omelette\" (1998)?", "answer": "R\u00e9mi Lange", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What British-Irish film star was born on February 9, 1945", "answer": "\"Mia\" Villiers Farrow", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "20th Century Boys was a heavy metal pairing of German lead vocalists Michael Bormann of Jaded Heart and Michael Voss of Mad Max, the duo recorded 11 songs by T. Rex as a tribute to Marc Bolan and released them as an album called \"Beware of the Rex!\", Bolan was an English singer-songwriter, musician, guitarist, and poet, best known as the lead singer of which glam rock band?", "answer": "T. Rex", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What county did Richard Alan Galichon grow up in?", "answer": "Nassau County", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Aurora Metro Center is a Regional Transportation District (RTD) light rail station on the R Line in Aurora, Colorado, the station is between the Aurora Municipal Center and which enclosed, two-level regional shopping center located in Aurora, Colorado, and covers a leasable area over 1 million square feet?", "answer": "Town Center at Aurora", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Between two musicians, Phil Mogg and Yoon Chae-kyung, who is older?", "answer": "Phillip John Mogg", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What animated fantasy film is based on the sixth studio album by the French band Dionysos?", "answer": "Jack and the Cuckoo-Clock Heart", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Inside Men stars a South Korean actor who also appeared in which 2014 film?", "answer": "My Love, My Bride", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the county seat for the crescent-shaped island located in 'Alal\u010