 what? Composers", "answer": "composer", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "What is the name of the actor who portrays the main protagonist in the 1997 police procedural television drama, broadcast on ITV1, that also featured the Irish actress who played Cruella De Vil in \"Once Upon a Time\"?", "answer": "David Hayman", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which star of the 2013 film \"Dom Hemingway\" studied at the Drama Centre London?", "answer": "Emilia Clarke", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Tamra Davis and Alexandre Aja both worked in what industry in two different countries?", "answer": "film", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Were Underdog and Monkey Kingdom released in the same year?", "answer": "no", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which town in northern New South Wales is Walgett Airport located ", "answer": "Walgett, New South Wales", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Kamov V-80 eventually evolved into that single seat Russian attack helicopter?", "answer": "Kamov Ka-50", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Gillo Pontecorvo and Ivan Tors, have which occupation in common?", "answer": "film director", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Kevin Quinn had a supporting role in what 2016 American television film directed by John Schultz", "answer": "Adventures in Babysitting", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the name of the active volcano in Mexico that has the city of Tetela del Volcan located on its slopes?", "answer": "Popocat\u00e9petl", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who created the television series that has \"Behold... The Inhumans\" and \"Those Who Would Destroy Us\" as the first and second episodes?", "answer": "Scott Buck", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Heather R. Mizeur lost the Democratic primary to what American lawyer and politician, who is currently serving as the U.S. Representative for Maryland's 4th congressional district?", "answer": "Anthony G. Brown", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "In what year did Malcom Terel Butler help the Patriots succeed over the Atlantic Falcons?", "answer": "2017", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What state with capital Podgorica is Peru\u0107ica located near?", "answer": "Montenegro", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What writer and sketch performer for many years on \"Late Night with Conan O'Brien\" had a series that aired consecutively each night between December 7, 2015 and December 11, 2015?", "answer": "Jon Glaser", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The Celtic Princess fell for The Prince of Rheged who was ruler of what modern day country? ", "answer": "Northern England", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who wrote and directed the movie that The Mummy Returns is a sequel to?", "answer": "Stephen Sommers", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Are George Stambolian and David Hedison of the same nationality?", "answer": "yes", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "Which director is from Japan, Ren\u00e9 Cl\u00e9ment or Ted Sharks?", "answer": "Ted Sharks", "type": "comparison"}, {"question": "At which university is the American football coach, who coached the 2012 USC Trojans football team, currently head football coach?", "answer": "Florida Atlantic University", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "The city in which The Analyst is based is located on which coast?", "answer": "Atlantic Coast", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "What is the birthday of the female co-star of the movie Steel Dawn?", "answer": "May 26, 1956", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Which Mary Mapes Dodge novel was adapted in 1910 for the film The Little Hero of Holland? ", "answer": "The Silver Skates", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "Who aired the 140th episode of the series overall that was the first after the departure of actor Isaac Hayes, after the episode Stan joins Scientology in an attempt to find something \"fun and free\"?", "answer": "Comedy Central", "type": "bridge"}, {"question": "When was the founder of Shanduka Group born ?", "answer": "17 November 1952", "type": "bridg